msgid "Puts the first crack in anything."
msgstr "在任何东西上砸开第一道裂缝。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:800 scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataPaths.gd:14
msgid "Trapper"
msgstr "陷阱师"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:800
msgid "Sets more snares than the Rift can spring."
msgstr "设的陷阱比裂隙能触发的还多。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:801
msgid "Slinger"
msgstr "投石手"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:801
msgid "Improvises a weapon out of whatever's at hand."
msgstr "随手拿起什么都能当武器。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:802
msgid "Pathfinder"
msgstr "探路者"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:802
msgid "Already knows where the floor gives way."
msgstr "早就知道哪里的地面会塌。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:803
msgid "Longshot"
msgstr "远射手"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:803
msgid "One arrow. Rarely needs a second."
msgstr "一支箭。很少需要第二支。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:804
msgid "Blade-Dancer"
msgstr "刃舞者"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:804
msgid "The opening strike is the whole performance."
msgstr "开场一击就是整场表演。"

#: locale/extra_msgids.txt scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:805
msgid "Warden"
msgstr "守卫"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:805
msgid "Has walked through worse hallways than this."
msgstr "走过比这更糟的走廊。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:806
msgid "Stormtracker"
msgstr "逐雷者"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:806
msgid "Follows the lightning instead of waiting for thunder."
msgstr "追着闪电跑，而不是等雷声。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:807
msgid "Rift-Ranger"
msgstr "裂隙游侠"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:807
msgid "Reads a hallway before it reads back."
msgstr "在走廊读懂它之前先读懂走廊。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:808
msgid "Deadfall Hunter"
msgstr "落石猎人"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:808
msgid "Sets the trap the Rift walks into instead."
msgstr "设下让裂隙自己走进去的陷阱。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:809
msgid "Voidwalker"
msgstr "虚空行者"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:809
msgid "Half-stepped out of the fight before it began."
msgstr "战斗开始前就已半步抽身。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:812
msgid "Shadowtracker"
msgstr "影踪者"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:812
msgid "Tracks by scent when the light gives out."
msgstr "光熄灭时凭气味追踪。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:813
msgid "Fieldscout"
msgstr "野外斥候"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:813
msgid "Knows exactly where to put an arrow."
msgstr "确切知道箭该射向哪里。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:814
msgid "Nightwarden"
msgstr "夜卫"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:814
msgid "Watches the dark so the party doesn't have to."
msgstr "替小队盯着黑暗。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:815
msgid "Sapling-Keeper"
msgstr "树苗守护者"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:815
msgid "Field dressings from whatever's growing nearby."
msgstr "用附近长着的东西就地包扎。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:816
msgid "Duskstalker"
msgstr "暮色潜猎者"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:816
msgid "Gone before the echo catches up."
msgstr "回声追上之前就已消失。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:817
msgid "Gale Marksman"
msgstr "疾风神射手"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:817
msgid "The wind carries the first shot true."
msgstr "风让第一箭准确无误。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:818
msgid "Rift-Piercer"
msgstr "破隙射手"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:818
msgid "Finds the one seam every ward has."
msgstr "找到每道守护都有的那条缝。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:819
msgid "Wintertide Archer"
msgstr "冬潮弓手"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:819
msgid "Colder with every arrow loosed."
msgstr "每放一箭都更冷一分。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:820
msgid "Rift-Eclipsed Warden"
msgstr "裂隙蚀月守卫"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:820
msgid "Every shadow in the Rift owes her an arrow."
msgstr "裂隙里的每道阴影都欠她一箭。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:822
msgid "Apprentice"
msgstr "学徒"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:822
msgid "Still learning to hold a spark steady."
msgstr "还在学着稳住一点火花。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:823
msgid "Cinderling"
msgstr "小火苗"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:823
msgid "Sparks first, thinks second."
msgstr "先冒火花，再动脑子。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:824
msgid "Fledgling Seer"
msgstr "见习先知"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:824
msgid "Sees the trap a half-second before it triggers."
msgstr "在陷阱触发前半秒就看见了它。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:825
msgid "Cinder-Adept"
msgstr "余烬术士"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:825
msgid "Every spell warms up the next."
msgstr "每个法术都为下一个预热。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:826
msgid "Frost Scholar"
msgstr "冰霜学者"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:826
msgid "Studies the Rift's cold so it can't study back."
msgstr "研究裂隙的寒冷，好让它没法反过来研究自己。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:827
msgid "Wardweaver"
msgstr "守护编织者"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:827
msgid "Weaves a ward faster than the Rift can break it."
msgstr "编织守护的速度比裂隙打破它还快。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:828
msgid "Stormcaller"
msgstr "唤雷者"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:828
msgid "Calls down more with every passing second."
msgstr "每过一秒就召下更多。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:829
msgid "Pyromancer"
msgstr "炎术士"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:829
msgid "The Rift itself seems to lean away."
msgstr "连裂隙本身都似乎要躲开。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:830
msgid "Archon of Storms"
msgstr "风暴执政官"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:830
msgid "Opens every Warden's door with thunder."
msgstr "以雷霆敲开每位守卫的大门。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:831
msgid "The Unbound"
msgstr "无缚者"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:831
msgid "No name holds it. No floor stops it."
msgstr "没有名字能束缚它。没有一层能阻挡它。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:834
msgid "Thornweaver"
msgstr "荆棘编织者"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:834
msgid "Grows a ward out of nothing but will."
msgstr "仅凭意志就能长出一道守护。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:835
msgid "Shade-Adept"
msgstr "暗影术士"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:835
msgid "The first spell is always the quiet one."
msgstr "第一个法术总是最安静的那个。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:836
msgid "Stoneward Mystic"
msgstr "石护秘术师"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:836
msgid "Turns skin to something closer to bark."
msgstr "把皮肤变得更像树皮。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:837
msgid "Grim Conjurer"
msgstr "阴郁咒师"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:837
msgid "Bargains with the dark for one more round."
msgstr "与黑暗讨价还价，再多换一回合。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:838
msgid "Verdant Oracle"
msgstr "翠绿神谕"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:838
msgid "Reads the future in root and leaf."
msgstr "从根与叶中读出未来。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:839
msgid "Duskglass Seer"
msgstr "暮镜先知"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:839
msgid "Sees the strike land before it's thrown."
msgstr "攻击还没出手，就看见它落下。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:840
msgid "Ashbound Theorist"
msgstr "灰缚理论家"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:840
msgid "Every equation ends in fire."
msgstr "每个方程都以火焰告终。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:841
msgid "Rift-Warden Magus"
msgstr "裂隙守卫术士"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:841
msgid "Wards the floor before the Rift finishes forming it."
msgstr "在裂隙成形之前就为这一层布下守护。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:843
msgid "Peddler"
msgstr "小贩"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:843
msgid "Sells bandages. Uses them too."
msgstr "卖绷带。也用绷带。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:844
msgid "Acolyte"
msgstr "侍僧"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:844
msgid "Prays quietly, heals quietly."
msgstr "静静祈祷，静静治疗。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:845
msgid "Herbalist"
msgstr "草药师"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:845
msgid "Carries a field kit for every wound."
msgstr "为每种伤口都备有急救包。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:846
msgid "Lay Brother"
msgstr "平信徒修士"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:846
msgid "Swings a censer like it owes him money."
msgstr "挥舞香炉的架势像是香炉欠他钱。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:847
msgid "Battle Chaplain"
msgstr "战斗牧师"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:847
msgid "Prays loudly enough to keep the party moving."
msgstr "祈祷声大到足以让小队继续前进。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:848
msgid "Zealot"
msgstr "狂信者"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:848
msgid "Faith, mostly. A blade, occasionally."
msgstr "主要靠信仰。偶尔靠刀刃。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:849
msgid "Rift-Medic"
msgstr "裂隙医者"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:849
msgid "Faster hands than the Rift has wounds to give."
msgstr "手比裂隙给伤口的速度还快。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:850
msgid "Dawnkeeper"
msgstr "守晓者"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:850
msgid "Carries first light into the deepest floor."
msgstr "把第一缕晨光带到最深的一层。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:851
msgid "Sanctified Shield"
msgstr "圣化之盾"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:851
msgid "Swears the party will not fall today."
msgstr "发誓今天小队不会倒下。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:852
msgid "Alchemist"
msgstr "炼金术士"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:852
msgid "Brews faster than the Rift can wound."
msgstr "熬药比裂隙伤人还快。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:855
msgid "Emberblessed Acolyte"
msgstr "余烬祝福侍僧"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:855
msgid "Prays with a lit candle, not a cold one."
msgstr "祈祷时点着蜡烛，而不是熄着的。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:856
msgid "Frostward Sister"
msgstr "霜护修女"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:856
msgid "Keeps the chill out of everyone but herself."
msgstr "把寒意挡在每个人身外，除了她自己。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:857
msgid "Vanguard Chaplain"
msgstr "先锋牧师"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:857
msgid "Blesses the blade before it's needed."
msgstr "在需要之前就为刀刃祝福。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:858
msgid "Hearth-Warden"
msgstr "炉火守卫"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:858
msgid "A fire that doesn't go out in the cold."
msgstr "一团在寒冷中不熄的火。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:859
msgid "Ember Confessor"
msgstr "余烬告解者"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:859
msgid "Absolves the Rift of its sins, briefly."
msgstr "暂时赦免裂隙的罪孽。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:860
msgid "Frost Anchorite"
msgstr "霜寒隐修士"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:860
msgid "Fasts, prays, and somehow still heals faster."
msgstr "禁食、祈祷，却不知怎的治疗得更快。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:861
msgid "Radiant Vanguard"
msgstr "辉光先锋"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:861
msgid "Leads with light, not caution."
msgstr "以光引路，而非谨慎。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:862
msgid "Sainted Ember"
msgstr "圣化余烬"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:862
msgid "The Rift's worst still flinches from her first word."
msgstr "裂隙最凶恶的东西听到她第一句话仍会退缩。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:863
msgid "Last-Light Martyr"
msgstr "残光殉道者"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:863
msgid "The party has never seen the floor she stood between them and."
msgstr "她挡住的那一层，小队从未亲眼见过。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:865
msgid "Scavenger"
msgstr "拾荒者"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:865
msgid "Knows which puddles not to step in."
msgstr "知道哪些水坑不能踩。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:866
msgid "Runaway"
msgstr "逃亡者"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:866
msgid "Has never once stood and fought fair."
msgstr "从来没有堂堂正正地站着打过一场。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:867
msgid "Cutpurse"
msgstr "扒手"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:867
msgid "Leaves with more than they came with."
msgstr "离开时带走的比来时多。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:868 scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataPaths.gd:23
msgid "Skirmisher"
msgstr "游斗者"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:868
msgid "Never where the last swing landed."
msgstr "永远不在上一击落下的地方。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:869
msgid "Footpad"
msgstr "拦路贼"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:869
msgid "Nobody's ever heard them arrive."
msgstr "从没人听见他们到来。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:870
msgid "Shadowfoot"
msgstr "影足"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:870
msgid "The Rift barely notices it was there."
msgstr "裂隙几乎察觉不到它来过。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:871
msgid "Fleetblade"
msgstr "疾刃"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:871
msgid "Gets faster the longer no one catches them."
msgstr "越久没人抓住，就越快。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:872
msgid "Nightblade"
msgstr "夜刃"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:872
msgid "Strikes from the dark and returns to it."
msgstr "从黑暗中出击，再回到黑暗。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:873
msgid "Wraithstep"
msgstr "魅影步"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:873
msgid "Leaves two footprints and no explanation."
msgstr "留下两个脚印，不作任何解释。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:874
msgid "Duskrunner"
msgstr "暮行者"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:874
msgid "Moves like the space between two heartbeats."
msgstr "移动起来像两次心跳之间的空隙。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:877
msgid "Herbrunner"
msgstr "采药跑者"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:877
msgid "Knows every plant the Rift hasn't poisoned yet."
msgstr "认得每一株裂隙还没毒死的植物。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:878
msgid "Arcane Pilferer"
msgstr "奥术窃贼"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:878
msgid "Steals more than coin from a warded vault."
msgstr "从受守护的金库里偷走的不只是钱币。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:879
msgid "Ironhide Footpad"
msgstr "铁皮拦路贼"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:879
msgid "Tougher than a rogue has any right to be."
msgstr "比盗贼应有的样子结实得多。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:880
msgid "Glyphhand"
msgstr "符文之手"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:880
msgid "Reads a ward's seams like a lockpick reads a door."
msgstr "读守护的缝隙，就像开锁器读门。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:881
msgid "Bramblefoot"
msgstr "荆棘足"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:881
msgid "The undergrowth hides more than it seems to."
msgstr "灌木丛藏着的比看上去更多。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:882
msgid "Rift-Slipper"
msgstr "裂隙滑行者"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:882
msgid "Steps half out of reality when it matters."
msgstr "关键时刻半步踏出现实。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:883
msgid "Wraithblade Adept"
msgstr "魅影刃术士"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:883
msgid "Every strike thinner than the last, and faster."
msgstr "每一击都比上一击更薄，也更快。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:884
msgid "The Unseen Hand"
msgstr "无形之手"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:884
msgid "Already struck before the boss noticed it arrive."
msgstr "首领还没察觉它到来，就已出手。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:885 scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataSkills.gd:122
msgid "The Final Cut"
msgstr "终末一刀"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataHeroes.gd:885
msgid "Nothing has landed a hit since the Rift learned her name."
msgstr "自从裂隙得知她的名字，就再没有东西击中过她。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataItems.gd:18
msgid "Bloodthirst Fang"
msgstr "嗜血獠牙"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataItems.gd:22
msgid "Heals the wielder for 25% of the damage they deal each round they attack. -15% hazard severity guard."
msgstr "每回合攻击时，回复造成伤害25%的生命。险境防护-15%。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataItems.gd:23
msgid "Widow's Edge"
msgstr "寡妇之刃"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataItems.gd:27
msgid "Instantly finishes a foe this hero's attack would drop below 15% HP. -10% damage otherwise."
msgstr "若该英雄的攻击会使敌人生命低于15%，立即将其终结。否则伤害-10%。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataItems.gd:28
msgid "Last Stand Plate"
