msgstr "苹果树上挂满微微发光的果实，长在一片本不该存在的田野里。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:503
msgid "Eat the fruit"
msgstr "吃果子"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:503
msgid "70%: every hero heals 30% HP · 30%: bellyache, everyone loses 10% HP"
msgstr "70%：每位英雄回复30%生命 · 30%：肚子疼，所有人损失10%生命"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:504
msgid "Fill a basket"
msgstr "装满一篮"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:506
msgid "Haunted Mill"
msgstr "闹鬼的磨坊"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:506
msgid "The mill wheel turns with no water and no wind, grinding something that glows."
msgstr "水车在没有水也没有风的情况下转动，碾磨着某种发光的东西。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:508
msgid "Take the rift-flour"
msgstr "拿走裂隙面粉"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:508
msgid "+12-18 Essence"
msgstr "+12-18精华"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:509
msgid "Jam the wheel"
msgstr "卡住水车"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:509
msgid "Might check · pass: the village thanks you, +4 Renown, +15 Gold · fail: everyone loses 10% HP"
msgstr "力量检定 · 成功：村子感谢你，+4声望，+15金币 · 失败：所有人损失10%生命"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:511
msgid "Vale Wayshrine"
msgstr "山谷路边神龛"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:511
msgid "A farmer's roadside shrine, its garlands somehow still fresh."
msgstr "一座农夫的路边神龛，花环不知为何仍很新鲜。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:513
msgid "Leave an offering"
msgstr "留下供品"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:513
msgid "Costs 10 Gold · every hero heals 20% HP · +2 Renown"
msgstr "花费10金币 · 每位英雄回复20%生命 · +2声望"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:514
msgid "Pray for strength"
msgstr "祈求力量"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:514
msgid "Every hero gains 20 XP"
msgstr "每位英雄获得20经验"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:516
msgid "Sunken Bell"
msgstr "沉没之钟"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:516
msgid "A bronze bell rises from the black water and tolls once, very slowly."
msgstr "一口青铜钟从黑水中升起，非常缓慢地敲响了一下。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:518
msgid "Ring it back"
msgstr "回敲一下"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:518
msgid "50%: a Rare-or-better relic surfaces · 50%: the water lashes out, everyone loses 15% HP"
msgstr "50%：一件稀有或更好的遗物浮出水面 · 50%：水猛然袭来，所有人损失15%生命"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:519
msgid "Leave quietly"
msgstr "悄悄离开"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:521
msgid "Leech Pool"
msgstr "水蛭池"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:521
msgid "Fat leeches drift in a warm pool. The old marsh healers swore by them."
msgstr "肥硕的水蛭在一池温水中漂浮。老一辈的沼泽医者对它们深信不疑。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:523
msgid "Bathe"
msgstr "泡一泡"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:524
msgid "Jar a few"
msgstr "装几只进罐子"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:526
msgid "Drowned Chest"
msgstr "沉没的宝箱"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:526
msgid "A chest sits chained under a foot of murky water."
msgstr "一个宝箱被锁链拴在一尺深的浑水下。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:528
msgid "Dive for it"
msgstr "潜下去拿"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:528
msgid "Agility check · pass: a Rare-or-better item · fail: everyone loses 12% HP"
msgstr "敏捷检定 · 成功：一件稀有或更好的物品 · 失败：所有人损失12%生命"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:529
msgid "Hook it with a rope"
msgstr "用绳子钩上来"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:529
msgid "+15-25 Gold"
msgstr "+15-25金币"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:531
msgid "Voices in the Fog"
msgstr "雾中之声"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:531
msgid "The fog whispers the names of heroes your guild has lost."
msgstr "雾气低声念着你的公会失去的英雄的名字。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:533
msgid "Answer them"
msgstr "回应他们"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:534
msgid "Press on in silence"
msgstr "沉默前行"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:534
msgid "+3 Momentum next fight"
msgstr "下一场战斗+3气势"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:536
msgid "Ash-Buried King"
msgstr "灰烬掩埋的国王"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:536
msgid "The statue of a forgotten king, half swallowed by ash, still holds out its hand."
msgstr "一尊被遗忘国王的雕像，半截埋在灰烬里，仍伸着手。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:538
msgid "Dig it out"
msgstr "挖出来"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:538
msgid "Might check · pass: a Rare-or-better relic · fail: everyone loses 10% HP"
msgstr "力量检定 · 成功：一件稀有或更好的遗物 · 失败：所有人损失10%生命"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:539
msgid "Pry off its gems"
msgstr "撬下宝石"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:539
msgid "+12 Essence"
msgstr "+12精华"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:541
msgid "Glass Bridge"
msgstr "玻璃之桥"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:541
msgid "A bridge of cooled volcanic glass arcs over a river of fire."
msgstr "一座冷却火山玻璃的桥拱跨在火河之上。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:543
msgid "Cross carefully"
msgstr "小心通过"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:543
msgid "Agility check · pass: +8 Essence, +3 Momentum next fight · fail: everyone loses 15% HP"
msgstr "敏捷检定 · 成功：+8精华，下一场战斗+3气势 · 失败：所有人损失15%生命"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:544
msgid "Go the long way"
msgstr "绕远路"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:544
msgid "Everyone loses 5% HP"
msgstr "所有人损失5%生命"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:546
msgid "Cult Offering"
msgstr "邪教供品"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:546
msgid "An abandoned fire-cult altar, piled high with offerings."
msgstr "一座废弃的拜火教祭坛，供品堆得高高的。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:548
msgid "+30 Gold · -3 Renown"
msgstr "+30金币 · -3声望"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:549
msgid "Scatter the ashes"
msgstr "扬撒骨灰"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:551
msgid "Ember Egg"
msgstr "余烬之卵"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:551
msgid "A warm egg rests in the embers, pulsing with light like a heartbeat."
msgstr "一枚温热的蛋躺在余烬中，光芒如心跳般脉动。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:553
msgid "Warm it"
msgstr "孵化它"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:553
msgid "40%: it hatches and leaves a gift, a Rare-or-better find, +10 Essence · 60%: it bursts, everyone loses 15% HP"
msgstr "40%：它孵化并留下礼物，一件稀有或更好的发现，+10精华 · 60%：它爆开，所有人损失15%生命"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:554
msgid "Take its shell"
msgstr "拿走蛋壳"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:554
msgid "+15 Essence"
msgstr "+15精华"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:558
msgid "The Glass Market"
msgstr "玻璃集市"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:558
msgid "In the middle of the rift, a stall. A thing with too many hands is selling fruit made of glass. It does not attack. It seems embarrassed to be seen. When your party comes closer it holds out a fruit and says, very clearly, in our language: please."
msgstr "裂隙中央有一个摊位。一个手多得过分的东西在卖玻璃做的水果。它没有攻击。它似乎因为被看见而难为情。你的小队走近时，它递出一个水果，用我们的语言清清楚楚地说：求你了。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:560
msgid "Buy a fruit"
msgstr "买一个水果"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:560
msgid "Costs 12 Gold · every hero heals 25% HP"
msgstr "花费12金币 · 每位英雄回复25%生命"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:561
msgid "Take one (it lets you)"
msgstr "拿一个（它任你拿）"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:561
msgid "+8-14 Essence · -1 Renown"
msgstr "+8-14精华 · -1声望"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:562
msgid "Leave it in peace"
msgstr "别打扰它"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:564
msgid "A Lost Child"
msgstr "迷路的孩子"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:564
msgid "A small creature hides behind a rock. It has the shape of the things you fight, but small, and it is crying. It flinches when your party comes near, then follows at a distance."
msgstr "一个小生物躲在岩石后面。它的样子像你们与之战斗的那些东西，只是很小，而且在哭。你的小队靠近时它缩了一下，然后远远地跟在后面。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:566
msgid "Walk it to the rift's heart"
msgstr "陪它走到裂隙中心"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:566
msgid "Every hero gains 15 XP"
msgstr "每位英雄获得15经验"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:567
msgid "Leave it your rations"
msgstr "把口粮留给它"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:567
msgid "Costs 10 Gold · +3 Renown"
msgstr "花费10金币 · +3声望"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:570
msgid "Rain That Falls Up"
msgstr "向上落的雨"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:570
msgid "Here the rain falls toward the sky, slow and warm, and collects in the air above your heads like a lake seen from underneath."
msgstr "这里的雨朝天空落去，缓慢而温暖，在你们头顶的空中聚集，就像从下方看到的湖。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:572
msgid "Stand in it"
msgstr "站在雨中"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:573
msgid "+8-14 Essence"
msgstr "+8-14精华"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:575
msgid "A Dark Post"
msgstr "熄灭的岗位"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:575
msgid "A pillar of glass stands in the rift, cracked and empty. Scratched into its base: a name, and the Accord's oath. Whoever held this post let go a long time ago."
msgstr "一根玻璃柱立在裂隙中，开裂而空荡。底座上刻着：一个名字，和盟约的誓言。守着这个岗位的人很久以前就放手了。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:577
msgid "Read the oath aloud"
msgstr "高声诵读誓言"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:577
msgid "Every hero heals 10% HP · +2 Renown"
msgstr "每位英雄回复10%生命 · +2声望"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:578
msgid "Chip out the crystal"
msgstr "凿下晶体"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:578
msgid "+10-16 Essence · -2 Renown"
msgstr "+10-16精华 · -2声望"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:612
msgid "Escort the salt carts"
msgstr "护送盐车"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:612
msgid "The salt carts want guards as far as the river ford. Nobody expects trouble, which is when it comes."
msgstr "盐车要人护送到河边浅滩。没人预料会出事，而麻烦往往就在这时找上门。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:613
msgid "Clear the mill cellar"
msgstr "清理磨坊地窖"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:613
msgid "Something is eating the miller's grain and he would rather not find out what."
msgstr "有东西在偷吃磨坊主的粮食，他宁可不知道那是什么。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:614
msgid "Count the border cairns"
msgstr "清点边界石堆"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:614
msgid "The Crown pays a surveyor's fee to anyone who walks the old border and counts what is still standing."
msgstr "王冠会付一笔测量费，给任何走完旧边界、清点出仍然矗立之物的人。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:615
msgid "Hunt the marsh lights"
msgstr "猎杀沼泽鬼火"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:615
msgid "Lights over the marsh have drowned three fishermen this month. The village has a purse for whoever puts them out."
msgstr "沼泽上的鬼火这个月已经淹死了三个渔夫。村里凑了一笔赏钱，给能把它们熄灭的人。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:616
msgid "Recover the toll chest"
msgstr "夺回过路费箱"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:616
msgid "Bandits took the bridge toll and went to ground in the quarry. Bring the chest back and keep a share."
msgstr "强盗抢走了桥上的过路费，躲进了采石场。把箱子带回来，你可以留一份。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:617
msgid "Map the drowned road"
msgstr "测绘被淹的道路"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:617
msgid "The old Accord road runs under the floodwater now. A merchant house wants it mapped before their rivals do."
msgstr "古老的盟约大道如今沉在洪水之下。一家商行想抢在对手之前把它绘成地图。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:618
msgid "Take the Hollow's tithe barge"
msgstr "劫下空洞的什一税驳船"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:618
msgid "A barge carries rift-glass up the river for the Hollow's buyers. It is guarded, and it is worth it."
msgstr "一艘驳船沿河运送裂隙玻璃，交给空洞的买家。船上有守卫，但值得一抢。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:619
msgid "Open an Accord vault"
msgstr "打开盟约宝库"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:619
msgid "A scholar swears an old guild vault lies under the burned chapel. The last party that went down came back two short."
msgstr "一位学者发誓，烧毁的礼拜堂下面有一座旧公会宝库。上一支下去的小队，回来时少了两个人。"

