#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1088
msgid "Untouched — seal 5 rifts with no one knocked out"
msgstr "毫发无伤——封印5个裂隙且无人被击倒"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1089
msgid "Climber — reach floor 25 of the Tower"
msgstr "攀登者——到达试炼之塔第25层"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1090
msgid "Summit — clear floor 100 of the Tower"
msgstr "登顶——通关试炼之塔第100层"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1091
msgid "Daily Duty — seal a rift with the daily twist"
msgstr "每日职责——以每日变奏封印一个裂隙"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1092
msgid "Dedicated — seal the daily twist 7 days in a row"
msgstr "坚持不懈——连续7天完成每日变奏封印"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1093
msgid "Build Complete — own a 4-piece boon set"
msgstr "构筑完成——拥有一套4件的恩赐套装"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1094
msgid "Legendary Guild — reach Legendary Guild tier"
msgstr "传奇公会——达到传奇公会等级"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1095
msgid "Paragon — raise a hero to Level 10"
msgstr "典范——将一名英雄提升到10级"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1096
msgid "Great Hall — have 10 heroes on the roster"
msgstr "宏伟大厅——名册上有10名英雄"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1132
msgid "Inspired"
msgstr "振奋"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1132
msgid "Steady"
msgstr "平稳"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1132
msgid "Shaken"
msgstr "动摇"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1132
msgid "Breaking"
msgstr "崩溃边缘"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1148
msgid "The Hollow Crown Company"
msgstr "空洞王冠佣兵团"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1166
msgid "Marshal Orla Venn"
msgstr "元帅Orla Venn"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1167
msgid "Kael Ashborn"
msgstr "Kael Ashborn"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1168
msgid "Ser Aldric Vane"
msgstr "Aldric Vane爵士"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1169
msgid "Mother Ilse"
msgstr "Ilse嬷嬷"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1170 scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1517
msgid "Captain Morrow"
msgstr "Morrow队长"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1182
msgid "Seal the small rifts, %s. Leave the real ones to us."
msgstr "去封印那些小裂隙吧，%s。真正的裂隙交给我们。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1183 scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1265
msgid "%s pays its heroes in promises, I hear."
msgstr "听说%s用承诺给英雄发薪水。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1184
msgid "Our recruits ask about %s. Then they sign with us."
msgstr "我们的新兵会打听%s。然后就跟我们签约了。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1185
msgid "Tell %s the quest board isn't a charity."
msgstr "告诉%s，任务板不是慈善机构。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1186
msgid "We'll send flowers when %s closes its doors."
msgstr "%s关门的时候我们会送花。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1187 scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1265
msgid "%s? I thought they'd disbanded."
msgstr "%s？我还以为他们已经解散了。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1206 scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1217 scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1514
msgid "The Night of Breaking"
msgstr "破碎之夜"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1206
msgid "The end of the Accord"
msgstr "盟约的终结"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1207
msgid "For three hundred years the guilds of the Accord kept the rifts shut. They swore one oath: close what opens, share what you find, never sell a rift. Then, in a single night, every rift in the Vale opened at once, and every Accord guild went in. None of them came back. By morning their halls stood empty.\n\nThe villages still need a guild. They have yours."
msgstr "三百年来，盟约的各公会一直让裂隙保持关闭。他们立下同一条誓言：关闭打开之物，分享所获之物，绝不出卖裂隙。然后，在一夜之间，山谷中的每一道裂隙同时打开，每一个盟约公会都走了进去。没有一个回来。到早上，他们的大厅已空无一人。\n\n村庄仍然需要一个公会。他们有了你的公会。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1212
msgid "The Hollow"
msgstr "空洞"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1212
msgid "The world sits on a thin crust. Under it is the Hollow, where things that never got to happen pile up: unfinished storms, roads never built, beasts that almost were. A rift is a crack in the crust, and what comes through is the Hollow trying on a shape. It copies what it finds, which is why each region's monsters look like that region."
msgstr "世界坐落在一层薄薄的地壳上。地壳之下是空洞，那里堆积着从未有机会发生的事物：未完成的风暴、从未修建的道路、差一点就存在的野兽。裂隙是地壳上的裂缝，从中涌出的是空洞在试穿某种形状。它模仿它找到的东西，所以每个地区的怪物都长得像那个地区。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1213 scripts/ui/BattleView.gd:1770 scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:1958
msgid "Essence"
msgstr "精华"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1213
msgid "When the Hollow touches air it hardens into crystal. Essence is unfinished possibility: put it into a hero and they grow into what they might have been, into a building and it becomes its better self, into a relic and it wakes. Gold pays people. Essence changes things."
msgstr "空洞接触空气时会凝固成晶体。精华是未完成的可能性：注入英雄，他们就会长成本可能成为的样子；注入建筑，它会成为更好的自己；注入遗物，它会苏醒。金币用来付给人。精华用来改变事物。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1214
msgid "The Accord"
msgstr "盟约"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1214
msgid "The oath of the old guilds: close what opens, share what you find, never sell a rift. The villages paid the guilds that swore it, and for three hundred years the crust held. Renown is the villages' trust; the best recruits go where it is."
msgstr "旧公会的誓言：关闭打开之物，分享所获之物，绝不出卖裂隙。村庄供养立下誓言的公会，三百年来地壳一直完好。声望就是村庄的信任；最好的新兵会去声望所在之处。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1215
msgid "The Assay"
msgstr "勘测石"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1215
msgid "Every hero who joins a guild is measured once on the Assay stone, by how much Essence they can hold without breaking: F to S. Rifts are measured on the same scale, so a Rank C rift is one a Rank C hero can stand in. SS and SSS were added after the Night of Breaking, by clerks who had run out of letters."
msgstr "每位加入公会的英雄都会在勘测石上测量一次，依据是他们能承载多少精华而不崩溃：从F到S。裂隙也以同样的尺度衡量，所以阶级C裂隙就是阶级C英雄能站得住的裂隙。SS和SSS是在破碎之夜之后，由用完了字母的书记员们加上的。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1216
msgid "The Five Paths"
msgstr "五条道路"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1216
msgid "The Accord trained fighters in five Paths: the Shield (warriors), the Bow (rangers), the Word (mages), the Vow (clerics) and the Knife (rogues). Below Rank B the Path is all a hero is. From Rank B there is enough Essence in them that it settles into a shape of its own, and the Path forks into a calling."
msgstr "盟约以五条道路训练战士：盾（战士）、弓（游侠）、言（法师）、誓（牧师）和刃（盗贼）。阶级B以下，道路就是英雄的全部。从阶级B起，他们体内的精华足以凝成自己的形状，道路便分化为一种天命。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1217
msgid "Every rift in the Vale opened at once, deeper than the Assay could measure, and every Accord guild answered. None came back. The new companies that took charters afterward never swore the Accord. Yours can choose to keep it."
msgstr "山谷中的每一道裂隙同时打开，深到勘测石无法测量，每一个盟约公会都响应了。没有一个回来。之后获得特许状的新团体从未宣誓加入盟约。你的公会可以选择守护它。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1220
msgid "Vaelith's badge"
msgstr "Vaelith的徽章"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1220
msgid "Under Vaelith's cloak was an Accord ranger's badge with the oath scratched out. She held a post on the Night of Breaking and walked away from it. The great Breach in the Vale was the post she left."
msgstr "Vaelith的斗篷下有一枚盟约游侠的徽章，誓言已被刮去。破碎之夜她守着一个岗位，然后离开了。山谷中那道巨大的裂口，就是她离开的岗位。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1221
msgid "The bargain"
msgstr "那笔交易"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1221
msgid "The guilds did not fall. On the Night of Breaking the Grandmaster of the Accord made a bargain with the Hollow: the strongest of the guilds would stand in the cracks and let the Hollow harden around them, and the Hollow would stay below. The pillars of light in the Endless Rift are those posts, still holding."
msgstr "各公会并没有陨落。破碎之夜，盟约大团长与空洞做了一笔交易：最强的公会成员站进裂缝，让空洞在他们周围凝固，空洞则留在下面。无尽裂隙中的光柱就是那些岗位，至今仍在坚守。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1222 scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1364
msgid "The forty-first post"
msgstr "第四十一号岗位"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1222
msgid "Sythrane was the Grandmaster. The bargain asked for forty-one posts, and she would not take the last one herself. The Hollow crowned her instead, and every post that tired and let go fed her. With her gone the rifts are quiet. The posts are still holding, and someone will have to relieve them."
msgstr "Sythrane就是大团长。交易要求四十一个岗位，而她不愿亲自守最后一个。于是空洞为她加冕，每一个疲惫放手的岗位都在供养她。她消失后，裂隙安静了。岗位仍在坚守，总得有人去换岗。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1232
msgid "Day 1. The Hollow is rising faster than we can close it. The Assay has no mark for what came through at Thornwood. I have called every guild to the Hall."
msgstr "第1天。空洞上涨的速度比我们关闭的速度更快。荆棘林涌出来的东西，勘测石上没有对应的刻度。我已将所有公会召集到大厅。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1233
msgid "Day 3. A voice answered from the deepest rift. It offered terms. I wrote them down so that I could refuse them properly."
msgstr "第3天。最深的裂隙中有个声音回应了。它提出了条款。我把它们记了下来，好好地拒绝它们。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1234
msgid "Day 9. Forty posts: forty of our strongest, standing in the cracks, held by the Hollow's own hardening. In return it stays below. I have not refused."
msgstr "第9天。四十个岗位：我们最强的四十人站在裂缝中，被空洞自身的凝固所固定。作为回报，它留在下面。我没有拒绝。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1235
msgid "Day 10. Lots drawn. Brannoch asked for the deepest post and I let him. I told them all I would come back for them myself."
msgstr "第10天。抽签完毕。Brannoch请求驻守最深的岗位，我答应了他。我告诉他们所有人，我会亲自回来接他们。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1236
msgid "Day 11. Vaelith asked who holds the Grandmaster's post. I said the Grandmaster keeps the ledger. That was not an answer, and she knew it."
msgstr "第11天。Vaelith问谁守大团长的岗位。我说大团长掌管账簿。这不是答案，她也知道。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1237
msgid "The Night. Every post is taken but mine. The terms say forty-one. The Hollow can count."
msgstr "那一夜。除了我的，每个岗位都有人了。条款上写的是四十一。空洞会数数。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1238
msgid "After. The Hollow came for the forty-first and found me ready to make a different bargain. It gives me a crown. I give it the posts, one at a time, as they tire. It is slower than refusing. That is all I wanted: more time."
msgstr "后来，空洞为第四十一个岗位而来，却发现我已准备好另做一笔交易。它给我一顶王冠，我把岗位一个个交给它，待它们疲惫之时。这比拒绝要慢。我想要的不过如此：更多时间。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1245
msgid "The Crown will return to the Vale. A single Royal Charter will go to the company that has done the most to close the rifts: every contract, for a generation. Until then, all chartered companies compete on equal terms.\n\nThe loudest of them, %s, led by %s, has noticed your guild."
msgstr "王冠将重返山谷。唯一一份王室特许状将授予在封闭裂隙上功劳最大的团体：一代人的所有契约。在此之前，所有获特许的团体平等竞争。\n\n其中声势最大的%s，由%s率领，已经注意到了你的公会。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1252
msgid "%s fights like one of mine. I'd rather ask than steal, so I'm asking: let them come, or pay them what they're worth. No hard feelings either way. — O. Venn"
msgstr "%s打起仗来像我的人。我宁可开口也不愿偷，所以我开口了：放他们过来，或者付他们应得的报酬。怎样都不伤和气。— O. Venn"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1253
msgid "Seal a Rank %s rift before payday. If you do, I'll say so to the herald. If you don't, I'll say that too. — O. Venn"
msgstr "在发薪日前封印一座%s阶裂隙。做到了，我会告诉传令官；做不到，我也会告诉他。— O. Venn"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1254
msgid "That contract is on the board and we can do it. So can you, maybe. First to sign it keeps it. — O. Venn"
msgstr "那份契约就在告示板上，我们能接。你们也许也能。先签者得。— O. Venn"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1255
msgid "Good work this week, %s. Do better next week."
msgstr "这周干得不错，%s。下周再好点。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1255
msgid "The Chorus sings about the rifts it has closed. %s hums."
msgstr "钢铁合唱团歌颂自己封闭的裂隙。%s只会哼哼。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1255
msgid "%s keeps its word. I'll give them that. I'll give them nothing else."
msgstr "%s说话算话，这点我承认。别的我一概不认。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1257
msgid "We can't train heroes like %s; we haven't the Gold. We can pay them, though, for a few weeks at least. They'll be happy. Probably. — Kael"
msgstr "我们培养不出%s那样的英雄，没那么多金币。但我们付得起薪水，至少撑几周。他们会高兴的。大概吧。— Kael"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1258
msgid "Rank %s by payday. We did one last week. Barely. Your turn. — Kael"
msgstr "发薪日前拿下%s阶。我们上周拿下过一座，险得很。轮到你们了。— Kael"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1259
msgid "We need that contract more than you do. I'm not proud of saying so. I'm saying it anyway. — Kael"
msgstr "我们比你们更需要那份契约。说这话我不光彩，但我还是要说。— Kael"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1260
msgid "The Wolves are hungry and %s is fat. Draw your own conclusions."
msgstr "狼群饿了，而%s正肥。你自己琢磨吧。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1260
msgid "Someday the Wolves will have a hall like %s's. With a roof."
msgstr "总有一天狼群也会有%s那样的大厅。带屋顶的。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1260
msgid "%s had a good week. We ate."
msgstr "%s这周过得不错。我们有饭吃了。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1262
msgid "Your %s has a good eye and a poor wage. I have the opposite problem. I'm sure we can come to an arrangement. — Vane"
msgstr "你的%s眼光好，薪水差。我正好相反。我相信我们能谈出个结果。— Vane"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1263
msgid "A Rank %s rift by payday, if your guild can manage it. Mine could, in its sleep. It frequently does. — Vane"
msgstr "如果你的公会办得到，就在发薪日前拿下一座%s阶裂隙。我的公会睡着都能办到，而且经常如此。— Vane"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1264
msgid "The Lance will be taking that contract. Do not trouble yourselves. — Ser Aldric Vane"
msgstr "那份契约由长枪团接手。诸位不必费心。— Ser Aldric Vane"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1265
msgid "The Charter will hang in the Lance's hall. I have already chosen the frame."
msgstr "特许状将挂在长枪团的大厅里。框我都选好了。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1267
msgid "%s has been unhappy, child. I notice these things. Pay them, or I will, and then we'll both know who listens. — Mother Ilse"
msgstr "%s近来不太开心，孩子。这些事我都看在眼里。付他们钱，否则我来付，到时候我们都知道谁更会倾听。— Mother Ilse"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1268
msgid "I've told the taverns you can seal a Rank %s rift by payday. Don't make an old woman a liar. — Ilse"
msgstr "我已经告诉各家酒馆，你能在发薪日前封印一座%s阶裂隙。别让老太婆当骗子。— Ilse"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1269
msgid "The Wolves will try for this one tomorrow. Take it first and I'll know you can be trusted with better news. Let it go and I'll take it, and I'll know that too. — Ilse"
msgstr "狼群明天要去争这一单。你先拿下，我就知道能把更好的消息托付给你。你放手，我就拿走，我也会记住这点。— Ilse"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1270
msgid "Mother Ilse sends her regards to %s, and a small bill."
msgstr "Ilse嬷嬷向%s问好，附上一张小账单。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1270
msgid "Everyone owes the Lantern something. %s just doesn't know what yet."
msgstr "人人都欠末灯会点什么。%s只是还不知道欠了什么。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1270
msgid "The Lantern hears %s is short this week. The Lantern lends."
msgstr "末灯会听说%s这周手头紧。末灯会放贷。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1272
msgid "%s deserves a company that values them. Ours does: twice the wage, half the danger. I can't explain the half. Trade secret. — Capt. Morrow"
msgstr "%s值得一个珍惜他们的团体。我们就是：双倍薪水，一半风险。那一半我解释不了，商业机密。— Morrow队长"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1273
msgid "Rank %s by payday? A friendly wager. There is always another rift, after all. We make sure of it. — Morrow"
msgstr "发薪日前拿下%s阶？友好地赌一把。毕竟裂隙永远还有下一座，我们保证如此。— Morrow"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1274
msgid "We'll take this one off your hands. Plenty of work for everyone; there always seems to be, near us. — Morrow"
msgstr "这单我们替你接了。活儿人人有份，在我们附近总是不缺。— Morrow"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1275
msgid "Plenty of work for everyone, %s. There always is."
msgstr "活儿人人有份，%s。永远都有。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1275
msgid "The Company wishes %s a quiet week. Truly."
msgstr "佣兵团祝%s度过平静的一周。真心的。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1275
msgid "Captain Morrow sent %s a bottle of good wine. No note."
msgstr "Morrow队长给%s送来一瓶好酒。没有附言。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1283
msgid "First payday. I'm Dobbs; I keep the books. The one with the ink is Wen."
msgstr "第一个发薪日。我是Dobbs，管账的。手上沾墨水的那个是Wen。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1283
msgid "I write down what happens. Try to make it worth writing."
msgstr "我负责记下发生的事。尽量让它值得记。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1283
msgid "And I'm the old woman who was here before both of them. Pay your heroes and they'll stay."
msgstr "我是在他们俩之前就在这儿的老太婆。按时付英雄薪水，他们就会留下。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1284
msgid "Someone walked out today."
msgstr "今天有人走了。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1284
msgid "Unpaid twice, or miserable. Usually both."
msgstr "两次没拿到薪水，或者过得太苦。通常两样都有。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1284
msgid "I'll write that they left. I won't write why. That's yours to fix."
msgstr "我会写下他们离开了，不会写为什么。那得由你来解决。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1285
msgid "I've added a name to the Memorial."
msgstr "我在纪念碑上添了一个名字。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1285
msgid "Say it out loud once. It helps."
msgstr "大声念一遍。会好受些。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1285
msgid "I'll take them off the payroll. Quietly."
msgstr "我会把他们从薪水名单上划掉。悄悄地。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1286
msgid "We're short. I want that written down, Wen."
msgstr "我们钱不够。Wen，我要你记下来。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1286
msgid "It's written down. It was written down last week, too."
msgstr "记了。上周也记了。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1286
msgid "Then underline it."
msgstr "那就画条线。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1287
msgid "Good feast."
msgstr "好宴席。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1287
msgid "Expensive feast."
msgstr "贵宴席。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1287
msgid "I'm writing 'good'."
msgstr "我写“好”。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1288
msgid "The herald wrote our name first this week."
msgstr "这周传令官把我们的名字写在了第一位。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1288
msgid "Did the herald pay anything?"
msgstr "传令官付钱了吗？"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1288
msgid "No."
msgstr "没有。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1288
msgid "Then it's ink."
msgstr "那就只是墨水。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1289
msgid "Our rivals bought new banners."
msgstr "对手买了新旗帜。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1289
msgid "The Accord never had banners."
msgstr "盟约从来没有旗帜。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1289
msgid "The Accord is gone."
msgstr "盟约已经不在了。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1289
msgid "Yes. Well."
msgstr "是啊。好吧。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1290
msgid "The vault is full. I don't trust it."
msgstr "金库满了。我不放心。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1290
msgid "Spend it on the heroes, then. Gold never closed a rift."
msgstr "那就花在英雄身上。金币从没封闭过裂隙。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1290
msgid "Gold paid the ones who did."
msgstr "但金币付给了封闭裂隙的人。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1291
msgid "These ledger pages. Hesper, did you know the Grandmaster?"
msgstr "这些账簿残页……Hesper，你认识大团长吗？"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1291
msgid "Everyone knew her. Nobody knew her."
msgstr "人人都认识她。没人了解她。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1291
msgid "That isn't an answer."
msgstr "这不算回答。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1291
msgid "It's the only one she ever gave."
msgstr "这是她给过的唯一回答。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1292
msgid "Nobody hurt this week."
msgstr "这周没人受伤。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1292
msgid "That's not a story."
msgstr "这算不上故事。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1292
msgid "It's the best kind. You'll learn."
msgstr "这是最好的那种。你会明白的。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1293
msgid "Hesper, what were the old guilds like?"
msgstr "Hesper，以前的公会是什么样的？"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1293
msgid "Louder. Better paid. Gone."
msgstr "更吵闹，薪水更高，都没了。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1294
msgid "Wages, upkeep, and a bill for a broken door."
msgstr "薪水、维护费，还有一张修破门的账单。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1294
msgid "Which door?"
msgstr "哪扇门？"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1294
msgid "The one someone kicked in after the last rift. I'm not saying who."
msgstr "上次裂隙回来后被人踹坏的那扇。我不说是谁。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1295
msgid "I sat the Assay at sixteen. The stone barely glowed."
msgstr "我十六岁参加测阶，石头几乎没亮。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1295
msgid "What rank?"
msgstr "什么阶级？"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1295
msgid "F. I'm still here. Most of the S's aren't."
msgstr "F。我还在这儿。大多数S阶的都不在了。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1296
msgid "I need another word for 'rift'. I've used it four hundred times."
msgstr "我需要“裂隙”的另一个说法。我已经用了四百次了。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1296
msgid "Use 'expense'."
msgstr "用“开销”。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1297
msgid "The recruits ask what the Accord was."
msgstr "新兵问盟约是什么。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1297
msgid "Tell them it was a promise. Tell them we're keeping it."
msgstr "告诉他们那是一个承诺。告诉他们我们在守着它。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1297
msgid "Are we?"
msgstr "我们在守吗？"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1297
msgid "Ask me next payday."
msgstr "下个发薪日再问我。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1299
msgid "{guild} paid on the seventh, too. Rain or not."
msgstr "{guild}也是七号发薪。风雨无阻。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1299
msgid "You never said you knew them."
msgstr "你从没说过你认识他们。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1299
msgid "You never asked who taught you the pay table."
msgstr "你也从没问过是谁教你看薪水表的。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1300
msgid "Someone left flowers under the {guild} banner."
msgstr "有人在{guild}的旗帜下放了花。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1300
msgid "Who pays for flowers?"
msgstr "谁会为花付钱？"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1300
msgid "Nobody. That's how you know they mean it."
msgstr "没人。所以你知道他们是真心的。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1301
msgid "{guild} spent less on feasts than we do."
msgstr "{guild}在宴席上花的比我们少。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1301
msgid "And kept fewer heroes."
msgstr "留下的英雄也更少。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1301
msgid "I hate it when the books agree with you."
msgstr "我讨厌账本站在你那边。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1302
msgid "{hero} is all over the old {guild} ledgers. Rift after rift."
msgstr "{hero}的名字遍布{guild}的旧账簿。一座裂隙接一座。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1302
msgid "{hero} carried me home from the Marches once. Don't write that down."
msgstr "{hero}有一次把我从沼泽背回家。别记下来。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1302
msgid "Already have."
msgstr "已经记了。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1303
msgid "Who goes down to the forty-first post now that {guild} is gone?"
msgstr "{guild}不在了，现在谁去第四十一个岗位？"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1303
msgid "We do. Once a year, on the Night of Breaking."
msgstr "我们去。每年一次，在破碎之夜。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1303
msgid "I'll put it in the ledger. No charge."
msgstr "我会记进账簿。不收钱。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1304
msgid "The tides got worse after {guild} burned the Terms."
msgstr "{guild}烧掉条款后，潮汐变得更凶了。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1304
msgid "The tides got honest."
msgstr "潮汐变得诚实了。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1304
msgid "Honest costs more."
msgstr "诚实的代价更高。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1305
msgid "{guild} wrote the forty-second line."
msgstr "{guild}写下了第四十二行。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1305
msgid "In my hand. I'd have liked a better pen."
msgstr "用我的笔迹。我倒希望有支好点的笔。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1305
msgid "Someone goes down next season. I've budgeted for it."
msgstr "下一季有人要下去。我已经做了预算。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1307
msgid "I found our village in the archive. A contract from ninety years ago: three rifts closed, paid in cheese."
msgstr "我在档案里找到了我们村子。九十年前的一份契约：封闭三座裂隙，报酬是奶酪。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1307
msgid "At what rate?"
msgstr "按什么价？"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1307
msgid "Better than ours."
msgstr "比我们的好。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1308
msgid "Hollin sent a sack of flour. And a bill for the doors."
msgstr "Hollin送来一袋面粉，还有一张修门的账单。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1308
msgid "Pay the bill. Keep the flour."
msgstr "付账单，留面粉。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1308
msgid "I'm writing down that they sent both."
msgstr "我要记下他们两样都送了。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1310
msgid "{guild} carried the Accord's archive out of the Spire. I've been reading it for a month."
msgstr "{guild}把盟约的档案从尖塔里搬了出来。我已经读了一个月。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1310
msgid "Find anything?"
msgstr "有什么发现？"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1310
msgid "Your handwriting. On most of it."
msgstr "你的笔迹。大部分都是。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1311
msgid "Hollin sent flour again, for {guild}."
msgstr "Hollin又送了面粉来，给{guild}的。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1311
msgid "{guild} is gone."
msgstr "{guild}已经不在了。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1311
msgid "Hollin doesn't seem to mind."
msgstr "Hollin似乎并不在意。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1312
msgid "{guild} took Morrow's money, back in the Charter War."
msgstr "{guild}在特许状之争时收过Morrow的钱。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1312
msgid "Everyone took somebody's money."
msgstr "人人都收过谁的钱。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1312
msgid "They took a lot of it."
msgstr "他们收得很多。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1313
msgid "There's a ranger in the {guild} ledgers who never signed for her pay. Just a V."
msgstr "{guild}的账簿里有个游侠从没签收过薪水。只有一个V。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1313
msgid "She never did like paperwork."
msgstr "她向来不喜欢文书工作。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1313
msgid "She never did like being paid, by the look of it."
msgstr "看样子她也向来不喜欢领薪水。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1314
msgid "{guild} just stopped. Do guilds do that?"
msgstr "{guild}就这么停了。公会会这样吗？"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1314
msgid "The good ones stop. The rest get stopped."
msgstr "好的公会会自己停下。其余的会被迫停下。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1314
msgid "Which were they?"
msgstr "他们是哪种？"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1314
msgid "Look at their banner. It's still up."
msgstr "看他们的旗帜。还挂着呢。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1322
msgid "An empty post"
msgstr "空着的岗位"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1322
msgid "The Endless Rift"
msgstr "无尽裂隙"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1323
msgid "The pillar is dark now. Somewhere in the Vale, a rift that has been quiet for twenty years draws breath. You did the right thing. The Hollow noticed.\n\n(Each champion freed in the Endless Rift brings the next Riftbreak a day sooner.)"
msgstr "石柱暗了下去。山谷某处，一座沉寂二十年的裂隙重新开始呼吸。你做得对。空洞注意到了。\n\n（每在无尽裂隙解放一位勇者，下次裂隙崩溃就提前一天。）"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1335
msgid "The last signature"
msgstr "最后的签名"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1336
msgid "The Terms lie open on the floor of the Hall: forty-one lines, forty signed. Sign the last, and one of your heroes takes the forty-first post forever; the rifts close for good. Or burn it, and every post is released at once; the champions come home, and the Hollow comes up with them."
msgstr "条款摊在大厅地上：四十一行，签了四十个。签下最后一行，你的一位英雄将永远守住第四十一个岗位，裂隙从此关闭。或者烧掉它，所有岗位同时解放：勇者们回家，空洞也随之升起。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1339
msgid "The Accord renewed"
msgstr "盟约续立"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1339
msgid "%s holds the forty-first post"
msgstr "%s守住第四十一个岗位"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1340
msgid "The Hall is quiet. Up in the Vale the villagers wake to a morning without a single rift on the horizon, and do not know why. The guild knows. Every year, on the Night of Breaking, someone climbs down to the forty-first post and tells %s how the harvest went.\n\n(Riftbreaks have ended. The Endless Rift, the ladder and the quests carry on.)"
msgstr "大厅一片寂静。山谷里，村民醒来时地平线上再无一座裂隙，却不知为何。公会知道。每年破碎之夜，都有人爬下第四十一个岗位，告诉%s今年收成如何。\n\n（裂隙崩溃已经结束。无尽裂隙、天梯和任务仍将继续。）"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1341
msgid "The Accord broken"
msgstr "盟约破碎"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1341
msgid "Every post released"
msgstr "所有岗位解放"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1342
msgid "The Terms burn green. Forty pillars go out at once, and forty people step into the dark and start walking home. Behind them, the Hollow rises to meet the sky. It will be a hard century. It will be an honest one.\n\n(Every champion of the old guilds is free. Riftbreaks end; a tide of the Hollow breaks every week, stronger for each one you hold.)"
msgstr "条款燃起绿焰。四十根石柱同时熄灭，四十个人走进黑暗，踏上归途。在他们身后，空洞升起，与天相接。这将是艰难的一百年，也将是诚实的一百年。\n\n（旧公会的所有勇者都已自由。裂隙崩溃结束；空洞之潮每周袭来，你每守住一次就更强。）"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1343
msgid "The Terms rewritten"
msgstr "条款改写"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1343 scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1359 scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1366
msgid "The forty-second line"
msgstr "第四十二行"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1344
msgid "Your guild writes one more line under the forty-first, in Hesper's hand, because hers is the only one the Terms accept: the posts are held in turns. Every guild in the Hall of Guilds sends someone down for a season, and they come back. The forty in the pillars walk home, and the Hollow stays shut behind the ones who take their place. Nobody holds it alone any more.\n\n(Riftbreaks have ended, every champion of this guild is free, and the old Accord halls can be restored.)"
msgstr "你的公会在第四十一行下又写了一行，用Hesper的笔迹，因为条款只认她的字：岗位轮流值守。公会之殿的每个公会都派人下去守一季，然后回来。石柱中的四十人走回家，空洞在接替者身后紧闭。再没有人独自守着它。\n\n（裂隙崩溃已经结束，本公会的所有勇者都已自由，旧盟约大厅可以修复了。）"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1350
msgid "There is a third way. Hesper's forty-second line is open: rewrite the Terms, and the posts are held in turns."
msgstr "还有第三条路。Hesper的第四十二行尚未写下：改写条款，岗位轮流值守。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1355
msgid "A note in the margin"
msgstr "页边的注记"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1356
msgid "Wen finds it while copying the last page: a line in the margin, in a smaller, neater hand than the Grandmaster's. \"If a guild ever has to choose, there is a forty-second line. Ask the clerk.\" Wen asks Hesper who the Grandmaster's clerk was. Hesper says she is tired, and goes to bed before the fire is out."
msgstr "Wen在抄写最后一页时发现了它：页边一行字，笔迹比大团长的更小、更工整。\"若有公会不得不做出抉择，还有第四十二行。去问书记官。\"Wen问Hesper大团长的书记官是谁。Hesper说她累了，炉火未熄就上床了。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1357 scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1359
msgid "Hesper, at the pay table"
msgstr "发薪桌旁的Hesper"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1358
msgid "\"I was the clerk,\" Hesper says, as if Wen had asked a minute ago and not a guild ago. \"I wrote her letters and her contracts, and I wrote the Terms out fair: forty-one lines. The night they were signed, she sent me home with a note that said I had a fever. I kept the note.\" She puts it on the table. It is in her own hand. \"I never told %s. I'm telling you.\""
msgstr "\"我就是那个书记官，\"Hesper说，仿佛Wen一分钟前才问过，而不是一整个公会之前。\"我替她写信、写契约，还誊清了条款：四十一行。签署那晚，她让我带着一张说我发烧的字条回家。那张字条我留着。\"她把字条放在桌上。是她自己的笔迹。\"我从没告诉过%s。我现在告诉你。\""

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1360
msgid "\"There was a line under the forty-first,\" Hesper says. \"She made me leave it blank. It says the Terms can be changed, once, by a guild that has both kept them and broken them, and a guild is everyone who came before it. %s kept them. %s burned them. When you stand in the Accord Hall, you won't have to choose between the two. Write the forty-second line.\""
msgstr "\"第四十一行下面还有一行，\"Hesper说，\"她让我空着。那一行写着：条款可以修改一次，由一个既守过又破过条款的公会来改，而一个公会包括在它之前的所有人。%s守过条款，%s烧过条款。当你站在盟约大厅时，不必在二者之间抉择。写下第四十二行吧。\""

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1361
msgid "\"There was a line under the forty-first,\" Hesper says. \"She made me leave it blank. It says the Terms can be changed, once, by a guild that has both kept them and broken them, and a guild is everyone who came before it. None of ours has done both yet. When one has, the line will be waiting.\""
msgstr "\"第四十一行下面还有一行，\"Hesper说，\"她让我空着。那一行写着：条款可以修改一次，由一个既守过又破过条款的公会来改，而一个公会包括在它之前的所有人。我们的公会还没有哪个两者都做过。等有了，那一行会在那里等着。\""

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1364
msgid "Your guild signed the Terms. %s took the forty-first post, and the Hollow stays below. The rifts that remain are old ones, and quiet."
msgstr "你的公会签署了条款。%s接过了第四十一个岗位，空洞被封在下面。剩下的裂隙都是旧的，而且安静。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1365
msgid "The Terms burned"
msgstr "条款已焚"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1365
msgid "Your guild burned the Terms. Every post was released, the old guilds came home, and the Hollow came up with them. The rifts are louder now, and nobody holds them shut but the guilds."
msgstr "你的公会烧掉了条款。所有岗位解放，旧公会回家了，空洞也随之升起。如今裂隙更加喧嚣，只有公会在守着它们。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1366
msgid "Your guild rewrote the Terms. The posts are held in turns now, a season at a time, by every guild that ever kept the Vale. The champions came home, and the Hollow stayed below."
msgstr "你的公会改写了条款。如今岗位轮流值守，每次一季，由所有曾守护山谷的公会承担。勇者们回家了，空洞仍封在下面。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1376
msgid "A Child's Name"
msgstr "孩子的名字"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1376
msgid "This Essence will not settle. It keeps the shape of a word. The miller's wife in Hollin heard about it and walked here in the rain: her son went into the Breach on the Night of Breaking, and she cannot remember what she called him."
msgstr "这份精华无法沉淀，一直保持着一个词的形状。Hollin磨坊主的妻子听说后冒雨走来：她儿子在破碎之夜走进了裂口，而她想不起自己曾怎么叫他。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1377
msgid "She holds the crystal to her ear, then says the name out loud, twice, as if checking it still fits. She does not thank you. She does not need to."
msgstr "她把晶体贴在耳边，然后大声念出那个名字，念了两遍，像在确认它还合适。她没有道谢。她不需要。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1378
msgid "A Street"
msgstr "一条街"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1378
msgid "The Essence from the last rift has a street in it: cobbles, a bakery, a blue door. A carter in the village swears it is the street he grew up on, in a town the Vale forgot."
msgstr "上一座裂隙带回的精华里有一条街：鹅卵石、面包房、一扇蓝门。村里一个车夫发誓那是他长大的街道，在一座被山谷遗忘的小镇里。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1379
msgid "He walks the street in his head all evening, door by door. In the morning he paints his own door blue."
msgstr "他整晚都在脑中沿着那条街走，一扇门一扇门地走。第二天早上，他把自家的门漆成了蓝色。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1380
msgid "A Song"
msgstr "一首歌"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1380
msgid "This Essence hums. The old women in the village know the tune and none of the words. The words were in the rift."
msgstr "这份精华在哼唱。村里的老妇人认得曲调，却不记得歌词。歌词留在了裂隙里。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1381
msgid "By nightfall the whole village is singing it, words and all, a little off-key. Wen writes them down."
msgstr "到傍晚，全村都在唱，连词带调，有点走音。Wen把歌词记了下来。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1382
msgid "A Face"
msgstr "一张脸"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1382
msgid "There is a face in this crystal, young and stern, in an Accord ranger's green. The village elder asks to see it and goes very quiet."
msgstr "这块晶体里有一张脸，年轻而严肃，穿着盟约游侠的绿衣。村里的长者要来看了看，变得一言不发。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1383
msgid "'My sister,' the elder says. 'I had forgotten I had one.' The crystal goes home with them and sits in the window."
msgstr "“我的姐姐，”长者说，“我都忘了我有过姐姐。”晶体随他们回了家，摆在窗台上。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1384
msgid "A Recipe"
msgstr "一份食谱"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1384
msgid "This Essence smells of bread. The innkeeper says her grandmother's loaf tasted like this, before the Night took the recipe out of everyone's heads."
msgstr "这份精华有面包的香味。旅店老板娘说，她祖母烤的面包就是这个味道，后来那一夜把食谱从所有人脑中夺走了。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1385
msgid "The inn smells of it for a week. Your heroes eat there free for the rest of the month, and nobody counts."
msgstr "旅店里香了一个星期。你的英雄这个月剩下的日子在那儿吃饭全免，也没人算账。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1386
msgid "An Oath"
msgstr "一段誓言"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1386
msgid "The words in this crystal are the Accord's oath, spoken in a voice nobody living remembers. Old Hesper asks to hold it."
msgstr "这块晶体里的话是盟约的誓言，由一个已无人记得的声音念出。老Hesper请求拿着它。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1387
msgid "Hesper holds it a long time. 'That was the Grandmaster,' she says, 'before.' She gives it to the village shrine and does not speak of it again."
msgstr "Hesper握了很久。“那是大团长，”她说，“在那之前。”她把它交给了村里的圣坛，此后再没提起。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1394
msgid "Hesper watches %s split the training post and keep swinging at the stump. 'The Path is choosing for you,' she says. 'You could let it.' They let it. Wen writes a new word under their name: %s."
msgstr "Hesper看着%s劈开训练木桩，又对着树桩继续挥砍。“道途在替你选择，”她说，“你可以顺着它。”他们顺了。Wen在他们名字下写了一个新词：%s。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1395
msgid "%s used to be first into every rift and first out. This week they stayed behind to walk the slowest hero home. Hesper calls that the moment a Path forks. Wen writes the new word down: %s."
msgstr "%s过去总是第一个冲进裂隙、第一个出来。这周他们留在后面，陪走得最慢的英雄回家。Hesper说，这就是道途分岔的时刻。Wen写下了新词：%s。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1396
msgid "%s says nothing about it at all. They turn up at the pay table one morning carrying themselves differently, and Hesper nods as if a debt has been paid. Wen asks what to write. Hesper says: %s."
msgstr "%s对此只字未提。某天早上，他们以不一样的姿态出现在发薪桌前，Hesper点了点头，像是一笔债已经还清。Wen问该写什么。Hesper说：%s。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1397
msgid "%s didn't want it. The Essence settled anyway, the way rain settles on a roof. Hesper sits with them until dark. 'Nobody's ready,' she says. 'The good ones are scared.' Wen writes: %s."
msgstr "%s并不想要。精华还是沉淀了，就像雨落在屋顶。Hesper陪他们坐到天黑。“没人准备好过，”她说，“好的那些都会害怕。”Wen写下：%s。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1398
msgid "%s prays before every rift, and this time the answer came back as a shape. Hesper says the Vow always answers in its own time. Wen writes it in the chronicle in her best hand: %s."
msgstr "%s每次进裂隙前都祈祷，这一次，回应化作了一个形状。Hesper说誓约总在它自己的时候回应。Wen用她最好的字迹写进编年史：%s。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1399
msgid "%s has been taking notes on their own Essence for weeks. The notes end mid-sentence on the day it settled. Wen copies the last line into the chronicle and adds the new word: %s."
msgstr "%s几周来一直在记录自己精华的变化。笔记在它沉淀那天戛然而止，停在半句话上。Wen把最后一行抄进编年史，又添上新词：%s。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1410
msgid "Mother Ilse's page"
msgstr "Ilse嬷嬷的那一页"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1411
msgid "Mother Ilse of the Last Lantern finds you after dark with a page torn from the Hollow Crown Company's books: a list of rifts, each with a date, a price, and the word opened. Captain Morrow has been opening rifts and selling the contracts to close them.\n\nShe will give it to the Crown's herald if you ask. Or the Company will pay well for a guild that keeps quiet, and its contracts would come to you."
msgstr "末灯会的Ilse嬷嬷趁夜找到你，带来从空洞王冠佣兵团账本上撕下的一页：一列裂隙，每条都有日期、价格和“已开启”字样。Morrow队长一直在开启裂隙，再把封闭它们的契约卖出去。\n\n只要你开口，她会把它交给王冠的传令官。或者，佣兵团会为保持沉默的公会出个好价钱，它的契约也会归你。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1414
msgid "The Company exposed"
msgstr "佣兵团败露"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1415
msgid "The herald reads Morrow's page aloud in the square. By evening the Hollow Crown Company's banners are down in three villages. By morning a rift has opened on the road to your camp, which is how you know the page was real.\n\n(+10 Renown. A Riftbreak is coming to your door.)"
msgstr "传令官在广场上大声宣读了Morrow的那一页。到傍晚，空洞王冠佣兵团的旗帜已在三个村子被扯下。到早上，一座裂隙在通往你营地的路上开启，你由此知道那一页是真的。\n\n（+10声望。一场裂隙崩溃即将来到你门前。）"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1416
msgid "A quiet arrangement"
msgstr "私下的约定"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1417
msgid "Morrow's contracts start arriving on your board, generous ones. Hesper reads the first, folds it, and doesn't say anything. She doesn't have to.\n\n(Contracts pay 25% more Gold for the rest of the campaign.)"
msgstr "Morrow的契约开始出现在你的告示板上，报酬丰厚。Hesper读了第一份，折起来，什么也没说。她不必说。\n\n（本战役余下时间，契约多付25%金币。）"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1422
msgid "The Royal Charter is yours"
msgstr "王室特许状归你了"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1423
msgid "The herald reads one name, and it is yours. Orla Venn is the first to shake your hand; Kael Ashborn asks for a job; Mother Ilse is already gone, which is how you know she was pleased. The Charter hangs in your hall, and the villages bring their troubles to a door they know.\n\n(Contracts pay 20% more Gold and Essence.)"
msgstr "传令官念出一个名字，正是你的。Orla Venn第一个与你握手；Kael Ashborn来讨份差事；Ilse嬷嬷早已离开，你由此知道她很满意。特许状挂在你的大厅里，村民们把麻烦带到他们熟悉的门前。\n\n（契约多付20%金币和精华。）"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1424
msgid "The Charter goes to %s"
msgstr "特许状归于%s"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1425
msgid "The herald reads a name, and it isn't yours. %s hangs the Royal Charter in their hall. The rifts don't care whose name is on the wall. Neither, in the end, do the villagers, as long as somebody comes."
msgstr "传令官念出一个名字，不是你的。%s把王室特许状挂在了他们的大厅里。裂隙不在乎墙上写的是谁的名字。说到底，村民也不在乎，只要有人来就行。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1431
msgid "%s and %s have stopped needing to talk in a fight. Wen noticed first. She has started writing their names in the chronicle as one entry, with an ampersand, and neither of them has complained."
msgstr "%s和%s在战斗中已经不需要说话了。Wen最先注意到。她开始在编年史里把他们的名字写成一条，中间用一个&连着，两人都没有抱怨。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1432
msgid "%s and %s sat up past the last candle arguing about a fight they won. Dobbs charged the guild for the candle. Hesper paid it herself and told him to let them be."
msgstr "%s和%s熬到最后一支蜡烛燃尽，争论一场他们打赢了的仗。Dobbs把蜡烛钱记到公会头上。Hesper自掏腰包，叫他别管他们。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1433
msgid "Ten rifts together. %s still can't say %s's full name right, and %s still lets it go. Wen has written down both versions."
msgstr "一起闯过十座裂隙。%s还是念不对%s的全名，而%s依旧随他去。Wen把两种念法都记了下来。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1434
msgid "%s took a hit meant for %s last week and has refused to talk about it since. Wen has written it down anyway. Hesper says that's how the old guilds started."
msgstr "上周%s替%s挡了一击，此后一直拒绝谈起此事。Wen还是记了下来。Hesper说，旧公会就是这样开始的。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1438
msgid "%s went first into every rift. Somebody had to."
msgstr "%s总是第一个进裂隙。总得有人去。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1438
msgid "%s never once asked how deep a rift went before stepping in."
msgstr "%s进裂隙前从没问过它有多深。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1439
msgid "%s was always first out of the rift, and always went back for whoever wasn't."
msgstr "%s总是第一个走出裂隙，又总是回头去接没出来的人。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1439
msgid "%s never sat still at the pay table. The chair is still pushed back."
msgstr "%s在发薪桌前从来坐不住。那把椅子至今还推在后面。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1440
msgid "%s said very little and meant all of it."
msgstr "%s话很少，但句句当真。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1440
msgid "%s held the line. That is the whole entry, and it is enough."
msgstr "%s守住了防线。这就是全部记录，足够了。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1441
msgid "%s was afraid of every rift and walked into all of them."
msgstr "%s害怕每一座裂隙，却走进了每一座。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1441
msgid "%s checked every strap twice. It wasn't the straps."
msgstr "%s每根皮带都检查两遍。问题不在皮带。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1442
msgid "%s prayed before every rift. We hope someone answered."
msgstr "%s每次进裂隙前都祈祷。愿有人回应了。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1442
msgid "%s kept the candles lit in the hall. We have kept them lit since."
msgstr "%s总让大厅里的蜡烛亮着。从那以后，我们一直让它们亮着。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1443
msgid "%s left a notebook full of questions. Wen is working through them."
msgstr "%s留下一本写满问题的笔记。Wen正在逐一作答。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1443
msgid "%s understood the Hollow better than any of us, and went to see it anyway."
msgstr "%s比我们任何人都更了解空洞，却还是去见了它。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1453
msgid "Company Ambush"
msgstr "佣兵团伏击"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1454
msgid "Morrow's sellswords, sent to settle a debt. The crossbowman snipes from the back; close on him first."
msgstr "Morrow的雇佣兵，来讨一笔债。弩手在后方狙击，先冲向他。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1455 scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataMonsters.gd:419
msgid "Company Sellsword"
msgstr "佣兵团雇佣兵"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1456
msgid "Captain Morrow, of the Hollow Crown"
msgstr "空洞王冠佣兵团的Morrow队长"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1458
msgid "Morrow is waiting"
msgstr "Morrow在等着"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1458
msgid "Word comes as you set out: Captain Morrow is at the bottom of this rift, and he has brought friends."
msgstr "出发时传来消息：Morrow队长就在这座裂隙的底部，还带了帮手。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1459
msgid "Morrow's key"
msgstr "Morrow的钥匙"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1460
msgid "Morrow goes down laughing, which is somehow worse. On his belt hangs an old iron key with the Accord's sigil: the key Pip swears she stole from a rift-lord, and the one he has been opening rifts with. By the end of the week the Company's banners are gone from the Vale.\n\n(+300 Gold, +10 Renown. No more Company ambushes.)"
msgstr "Morrow倒下时还在笑，这反倒更糟。他腰间挂着一把带盟约纹章的旧铁钥匙：Pip发誓是她从某个裂隙领主那儿偷来的，也正是他用来开启裂隙的那把。不到一周，佣兵团的旗帜就从山谷里消失了。\n\n（+300金币，+10声望。佣兵团不再伏击。）"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1469
msgid "a child's name"
msgstr "一个孩子的名字"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1469
msgid "a street with a blue door"
msgstr "一条有蓝门的街"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1469
msgid "a song"
msgstr "一首歌"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1470
msgid "a young ranger's face"
msgstr "一个年轻游侠的脸"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1470
msgid "the smell of bread"
msgstr "面包的香味"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1470
msgid "the Accord's oath"
msgstr "盟约的誓言"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1471
msgid "%s remembers"
msgstr "%s记起来了"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1471
msgid "An echo, kept"
msgstr "一段被留下的回响"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1472
msgid "%s has been quiet since you kept the echo. There was %s in it, and %s knew it, from a life they don't remember living.\n\n(%s is Echo-Touched: +6%% ability power.)"
msgstr "自从你留下那段回响，%s就一直很沉默。回响里有%s，而%s认得它，来自一段他们不记得活过的人生。\n\n（%s获得回响之触：+6%%技能强度。）"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1474 scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1476
msgid "Ezra the Pale"
msgstr "苍白的Ezra"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1475
msgid "A pale man with a lantern has been following the echoes. Ezra studies what the rifts take from people, and he keeps a little of it in the lantern, for safekeeping. He asks what you did with yours. When you tell him, he bows, which nobody in the Vale has seen him do."
msgstr "一个提灯的苍白男人一直在追寻回响。Ezra研究裂隙从人们身上夺走的东西，并在灯里存下一点，说是代为保管。他问你怎么处理了你的那些。听完后他鞠了一躬，山谷里还没人见他这样做过。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1477
msgid "A pale man with a lantern has been following the echoes. Ezra studies what the rifts take from people. He asks to see your vault, goes very still, and asks how much of it you have spent, and on what, and whether you kept a list. 'It was yours to spend,' he says at the door. 'I hope it was worth what it cost them.'"
msgstr "一个提灯的苍白男人一直在追寻回响。Ezra研究裂隙从人们身上夺走的东西。他要求看看你的金库，随即一动不动，问你花了多少、花在什么上、有没有留一份清单。“那是你的，你可以花，”他在门口说，“希望它值得他们付出的代价。”"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1480 scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1482
msgid "What the Vale remembers"
msgstr "山谷记得什么"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1481
msgid "In the weeks after, people stop in the street and say names out loud. A song nobody knew is sung at every harvest. The empty guild halls fill with flowers, and yours gets the most, from people who never met you."
msgstr "此后几周，人们会在街上停下，大声念出一些名字。一首无人知晓的歌在每次丰收时被传唱。空荡的公会大厅摆满了鲜花，你的大厅收到的最多，来自从未见过你的人。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1483
msgid "Something leaves the Vale with the last of the rifts, quietly, and nobody can say what. Your guild is the strongest the Vale has ever had. Ezra's lantern is found on your doorstep one morning, empty, with no note."
msgstr "随着最后的裂隙，有什么东西悄悄离开了山谷，没人说得清是什么。你的公会是山谷有史以来最强的。某天早上，Ezra的灯出现在你家门口，空的，没有字条。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1487
msgid "Wen asks %s for a line for the chronicle: something learned in fifty rifts. %s thinks about it for a long time. 'Bring more bandages than you think,' they say. Wen writes it down exactly."
msgstr "Wen请%s为编年史留一句话：五十座裂隙里学到的东西。%s想了很久。“绷带要比你以为的多带些，”他们说。Wen一字不差地记了下来。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1488
msgid "Fifty rifts. Dobbs works out what %s has cost the guild in wages and what they have brought home, then quietly tears up the page. Wen asks why. 'Some sums you don't show anyone,' says Dobbs. %s pretends not to hear."
msgstr "五十座裂隙。Dobbs算出了%s花了公会多少薪水、又带回了多少，然后悄悄撕掉了那一页。Wen问为什么。“有些账不给任何人看，”Dobbs说。%s假装没听见。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1489
msgid "Hesper gives %s her old Accord pin for their fiftieth rift. It is bent and tarnished and nobody has ever seen her take it off. %s wears it on the inside of their coat."
msgstr "Hesper把她的旧盟约徽章送给%s，纪念他们的第五十座裂隙。徽章弯了，也失去了光泽，没人见过她摘下它。%s把它别在外套内侧。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1497
msgid "Free Company"
msgstr "自由团"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1497
msgid "As the Vale knows guilds: three heroes and 280 Gold."
msgstr "山谷所熟知的公会：三名英雄和280金币。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1498
msgid "Mercenary Company"
msgstr "佣兵团"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1499
msgid "Hired swords: start with 320 more Gold. Contracts pay 20% more Gold, wages are 15% higher, and Renown comes 20% slower. The Hollow Crown Company will make you an offer."
msgstr "雇佣之剑：开局多得320金币。契约多付20%金币，薪水高15%，声望增长慢20%。空洞王冠佣兵团会向你开价。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1500
msgid "Temple Order"
msgstr "圣殿修会"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1501
msgid "Sworn to mend: start with 80 less Gold. Wages are 20% lower and downed heroes are back a run sooner. An echo given back earns twice the Renown; one kept, half the Essence."
msgstr "立誓疗愈：开局少80金币。薪水低20%，倒下的英雄提前一轮归队。归还回响获得双倍声望；留下回响，精华减半。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1502
msgid "The Lantern's Smugglers"
msgstr "末灯会走私者"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1503
msgid "Mother Ilse's people: start with 350 Gold. Shop prices are 25% lower, the Last Lantern is never your rival, and keeping quiet in the Charter War pays 40% more Gold instead of 25%."
msgstr "Ilse嬷嬷的人：开局350金币。商店价格低25%，末灯会永远不会成为你的对手，在特许状之争中保持沉默可多得40%金币，而非25%。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1504
msgid "Vaelith's Rangers"
msgstr "Vaelith的游侠"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1505
msgid "Deserters' wages: start with 100 less Gold. Every recruit board holds a ranger, rangers deal 10% more damage, and Riftbreaks warn you a day earlier. The Iron Chorus won't compete with deserters."
msgstr "逃兵的薪水：开局少100金币。每次招募都有一名游侠，游侠伤害提高10%，裂隙崩溃提前一天预警。钢铁合唱团不会与逃兵竞争。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1506
msgid "The Ninth Lamp"
msgstr "第九灯"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1507
msgid "Keepers of the sky: Essence gains are 20% lower, but every seal earns 1 more Renown, echoes turn up twice as often and every kept echo touches a hero, and the Arcane Lab starts at level 1."
msgstr "天空的守护者：精华获取降低20%，但每次封印多得1声望，回响出现频率翻倍且每段留下的回响都会触及一名英雄，奥术实验室从1级起步。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1508
msgid "Last of the Accord"
msgstr "盟约遗孤"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1509
msgid "Old Hesper's own guild: the Grandmaster's ledger pages turn up twice as often, but the Hollow knows you, and Riftbreaks come a day sooner."
msgstr "老Hesper自己的公会：大团长的账簿残页出现频率翻倍，但空洞认得你，裂隙崩溃会提前一天。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1512
msgid "Kept quiet in a Charter War"
msgstr "在特许状之争中保持沉默"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1512
msgid "Finish a campaign"
msgstr "完成一场战役"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1514
msgid "Old Hesper remembers"
msgstr "老Hesper的回忆"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1515
msgid "Hesper had a fever on the Night of Breaking and missed it. Every other guild of the Accord went into the rifts that night, hers too, and none came back. Twenty years on she has a hall again, three recruits, and the old oath: close what opens, share what you find, never sell a rift. She means to keep it this time."
msgstr "破碎之夜那天Hesper发了烧，错过了。盟约的其他所有公会那晚都走进了裂隙，包括她的公会，无一归来。二十年后，她又有了一座大厅、三名新兵和那句古老誓言：开启的必须关闭，所得的必须分享，绝不出卖裂隙。这一次她打算守住它。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1517
msgid "An offer from the Company"
msgstr "佣兵团的提议"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1518
msgid "Captain Morrow sends a man with a ledger and a good coat. The Hollow Crown Company would take your contracts off your hands, and your guild with them, at a fair price. He leaves the paper on the table. Nobody signs it. Dobbs reads it twice."
msgstr "Morrow队长派来一个带着账本、穿着好外套的人。空洞王冠佣兵团愿以公道价格接手你的契约，连同你的公会一起。他把文书留在桌上。没人签字。Dobbs读了两遍。"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1524
msgid "Never Sell a Rift"
msgstr "绝不出卖裂隙"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1524
msgid "The Accord's own rule: in the Charter War, keeping quiet is not an option."
