msgstr "“山谷守护者”称号和20桂冠"

#: scripts/autoload/game_data/GameDataModes.gd:1552
msgid "The last hall is the one the Accord was sworn in. Its doors open with the key Pip stole from Morrow. Inside is a long table, forty-one chairs, and one that someone has dusted every year. The Vale has its keepers again."
msgstr "最后一座大厅是盟约立誓之地。大门用Pip从Morrow那儿偷来的钥匙打开。里面有一张长桌、四十一把椅子，其中一把每年都有人擦拭。山谷再次有了守护者。"

