#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2002
msgid "Heroes are hired as base classes and train into a Path at the Training Yard: stage 1 at Rank D, stage 2 at Rank B, stage 3 at Rank S. Each subclass is a stage of one Path with its own Twist. Unlocked subclasses are remembered; a new guild can carry them over with Laurels."
