msgstr "大团长的账簿 — %d/%d页"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2240
msgid "Pages turn up in sealed rifts as the campaign goes on; a finale always yields one."
msgstr "随着战役推进，账页会出现在封印的裂隙中；终章必定掉落一页。"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2245
msgid "%d page%s still missing"
msgstr "还缺%d页%s"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2249
msgid "What the champions remember — %d/%d freed"
msgstr "勇者们的记忆 — 已解放%d/%d"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2251
msgid "Each act's finale frees a champion of the old guilds; more wait in pillars of light in the Descent and Rank B+ rifts."
msgstr "每一幕的终章都会解放一位旧公会的勇者；更多勇者在深渊下行和B+阶裂隙的光柱中等待。"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2267
msgid "Items are hero-bound gear. Weapon items fill a hero's weapon slots (1, or 2 for a dual-wield class); Armor and Focus items share one \"gear\" slot pool that grows with hero rank. A Common rolls one stat, a Rare one bigger stat and a named effect, an Epic two stats and a stronger effect (some effects only come on Epics). Legendaries are unique."
msgstr "物品是英雄专属的装备。武器类物品占用英雄的武器栏（1个，双持职业为2个）；护甲和专注类物品共用一个\"装备\"栏位池，随英雄阶级增长。普通物品随机一项属性，稀有物品一项更高的属性和一个命名效果，史诗物品两项属性和更强的效果（部分效果仅出现在史诗上）。传奇物品独一无二。"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2276
msgid "Stats: %s"
msgstr "属性：%s"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2278
msgid " (Epic)"
msgstr " （史诗）"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2282
msgid "Relics bend a rule for the whole guild: each is one of a kind, found from Act I's finale on (finales, an elite's loot, a rift shop, events, the Tower). They sit on the Relic Altar (Inventory), 3 slots and more with the Relic Vault. Path relics are different: a hero of the relic's Path carries it, and it works while they fight."
msgstr "遗物为整个公会改写一条规则：每件都独一无二，从第一幕终章起可获得（终章、精英的战利品、裂隙商店、事件、试炼之塔）。它们放在遗物祭坛（物品栏）上，有3个栏位，遗物库可增加更多。道途遗物不同：由该道途的一位英雄携带，在其战斗时生效。"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2289
msgid "An act's finale, an elite, a rift shop or an event"
msgstr "某一幕的终章、精英、裂隙商店或事件"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2291
msgid "Tower of Trials, floor %d guardian"
msgstr "试炼之塔第%d层守护者"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2294
msgid "Legendaries — %d/%d found"
msgstr "传奇 — 已找到%d/%d"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2332
msgid "The Smithy combines three spare items of one category and rarity into one of the next rarity up (from Act III)."
msgstr "铁匠铺把同一类别和稀有度的三件多余物品合成为下一稀有度的一件（从第三幕起）。"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2336
msgid "[color=#%s]3 × %s[/color]  →  [color=#%s]1 × %s[/color]   [color=#%s](numbers × %s)[/color]"
msgstr "[color=#%s]3 × %s[/color]  →  [color=#%s]1 × %s[/color]   [color=#%s]（数值 × %s）[/color]"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2342
msgid "Items: three of the same category (Weapon, Armor or Focus). The new item rolls fresh stats at the best rank among the three."
msgstr "物品：三件同类别（武器、护甲或专注）。新物品以三者中最高的阶级重新随机属性。"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2343
msgid "Relics aren't combined: each is a rule of its own."
msgstr "遗物不能合成：每一件都是一条独立的规则。"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2344
msgid "Equipped gear never goes in. Legendaries can't be crafted or fed in: they are fixed finds."
msgstr "已装备的装备不会被投入。传奇无法制作或投入：它们是固定的发现。"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2356
msgid "Ready now — %d"
msgstr "现在可制作 — %d"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2358
msgid "Nothing yet: no three spare pieces of one kind and rarity."
msgstr "暂无：没有三件同类同稀有度的闲置物品。"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2360
msgid "%s: %d spare, %d craft%s"
msgstr "%s：闲置%d，可制作%d%s"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2362
msgid "Open the Smithy"
msgstr "打开铁匠铺"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2372
msgid "Your camp was an Accord hall once. Its 13 rooms are rebuilt with Gold, a few at a time as the guild grows: Operations after two seals, Infrastructure, Logistics and Wardcraft in Act II, Research in Act III. Every level adds its effect and a little upkeep; some levels unlock a perk (a first-strike bonus, a boss Essence cache, extra relic slots…). Guild Tier, and the hall's art, track total levels. At the end of Acts I, III and V you are offered two of the six wings and build one, 3 of 6 per guild. A room damaged by a breach works a level lower until you repair it with Gold."
msgstr "你的营地曾是盟约的一座大厅。它的13个房间用金币重建，随公会成长逐步开放：两次封印后是作战，第二幕是设施、后勤和守御术，第三幕是研究。每一级都增加效果和一点维护费；有些等级会解锁加成（先手伤害加成、首领精华宝藏、额外遗物栏位……）。公会等级和大厅的样貌随总等级提升。在第一、三、五幕结束时，会从六翼中提供两翼供你建造其一，每个公会6选3。被破口损坏的房间在用金币修复前会低一级运作。"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2373
msgid "From Act III, the Rift Ladder offers a twist each day: a rule and a starting boon that come from the date, so every guild faces the same one. Tick it and your next ladder rift (any rank) carries it; one try a day. Sealing it pays bonus Essence and grows your streak. Records (Guild > Records) track achievements, lifetime statistics and your last 30 runs; the Memorial remembers heroes lost for good."
msgstr "从第三幕起，裂隙天梯每天提供一个变奏：一条规则和一个初始恩赐，由日期决定，因此每个公会面对的都相同。勾选后，你的下一个天梯裂隙（任意阶级）将带上它；每天一次机会。封印后可获得额外精华并延续连胜。记录（公会 > 记录）会追踪成就、生涯统计和你最近30次裂隙行动；纪念碑铭记永远逝去的英雄。"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2374
msgid "Hero voices"
msgstr "英雄语音"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2374
msgid "A hero's born quirk sets their personality (Bold, Quick, Stoic, Nervous, Devout or Scholarly), shown on their sheet. They speak up in fights when they land a big kill, hang on at low health or see an ally fall, and one of them sums up every win."
msgstr "英雄天生的特质决定其性格（勇敢、敏捷、坚忍、紧张、虔诚或博学），显示在其资料上。他们在完成漂亮击杀、低血坚持或看到友方倒下时会开口，每次胜利也会有一人总结。"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2375
msgid "Boss phases"
msgstr "首领阶段"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2375
msgid "Every boss changes once it drops to half health: Call the Horde (two foes join), Fury (hits 20% harder and winds up more often) or Last Bastion (a ward worth 12% of its health). Its plate shows which, and the warning bar calls it out as it gets close, so save burst and Defend for the turn."
msgstr "每个首领在生命值降至一半时都会变化：召唤兽群（两名敌人加入）、狂怒（伤害提高20%并更频繁地蓄力）或最后堡垒（相当于其12%生命值的护盾）。其铭牌会显示是哪一种，接近时警告条也会提示，所以留好爆发，在那回合防御。"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2376
msgid "Elite affixes"
msgstr "精英词缀"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2376
msgid "Elites roll an affix: Vampiric, Thorned, Shielded, Venomous, Juggernaut, Blazing, Hasted (acts twice) or Commander (brings two escorts). Rank B+ rifts give them two. Hover the badges on their plate to read them."
msgstr "精英会随机一个词缀：吸血、荆棘、护盾、剧毒、主宰、炽燃、迅捷（行动两次）或指挥官（带两名护卫）。B+阶裂隙中有两个。悬停其铭牌上的徽章可查看。"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2377 scripts/ui/RiftRunView.gd:616
msgid "Boons"
msgstr "恩赐"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2377
msgid "Beating an elite in a rift offers 1 of 3 boons that last until that rift ends. Boons come in seven families (Ember, Frost, Blood, Steel, Storm, Shadow, Holy); owning 2 of a family adds a set bonus and 4 a strong capstone, so a run can grow into a build. Not offered in the Tower."
msgstr "在裂隙中击败精英可三选一获得恩赐，持续到该裂隙结束。恩赐分为七个家族（余烬、冰霜、鲜血、钢铁、风暴、暗影、神圣）；同一家族拥有2个可获得套装加成，4个可获得强力终极效果，因此一次行动可以逐渐成型。试炼之塔中不提供。"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2378
msgid "Guild Orders"
msgstr "公会指令"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2378
msgid "Lv2 of the Infirmary, Drill Yard, Trade Network and Scouts' Lodge each unlock an order you can call inside a rift: Supply Drop (heal 35% between fights), Rally (act first and hit 30% harder this round), Requisition (reroll a fight's loot) and Scout Ahead (reroll a fork). 1 order per rift, 2 at Renowned tier, 3 at Legendary."
msgstr "医务室、操练场、贸易网络和斥候小屋的2级各解锁一个可在裂隙中发动的指令：空投补给（战斗间恢复35%）、集结（本回合先手且伤害提高30%）、征用（重掷一场战斗的战利品）和前方侦察（重掷一个岔路）。每座裂隙1个指令，声名远扬等级2个，传奇等级3个。"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2379 scripts/ui/Main.gd:2519
msgid "Rift Ladder"
msgstr "裂隙天梯"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2379
msgid "Rifts come in ranks, F to SSS. F-D are Lesser rifts, C and up Greater rifts (open after Act I). Each rank hits harder than the last and pays more; from B up they add rules (more elites, harsher hazards, fewer shops, bosses with two mechanics). Seal a rank to open the next. Gear drops at the rank of the rift it came from."
msgstr "裂隙分为F到SSS阶。F-D为次级裂隙，C及以上为高级裂隙（第一幕后开放）。每一阶都比上一阶更强、报酬更高；从B阶起会增加规则（更多精英、更凶险的险境、更少商店、拥有两种机制的首领）。封印一阶以开放下一阶。装备按掉落裂隙的阶级生成。"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2380
msgid "Bonds"
msgstr "羁绊"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2380
msgid "Heroes who seal rifts together grow a bond: level 1, 2 and 3 after 2, 5 and 10 rifts. Each level adds 2% party damage while both stand in a fight (up to the cap). Bonds show on the hero sheet's History tab."
msgstr "一起封印裂隙的英雄会建立羁绊：在2、5、10座裂隙后分别达到1、2、3级。两人都在战斗中站着时，每级使小队伤害+2%（有上限）。羁绊显示在英雄资料的历史页。"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2381
msgid "Ability Awakening"
msgstr "技能觉醒"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2381
msgid "Spend Skill Points once to give a hero's Ability a secondary effect (by ability: +2 Momentum back, a lingering debuff, a party dodge boost, a self-shield, or a small damage stack)."
msgstr "花费一次技能点，为英雄的技能增加次要效果（视技能而定：返还2气势、持续减益、小队闪避加成、自身护盾或少量伤害叠加）。"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2382
msgid "Heroes stand in the front or back row. Foes aim most attacks at the front row; Snipes hunt the back. Warriors and rogues hit at half strength with a basic attack from the back row, and some skills need a row. Move (7) switches rows for a turn. Back-row foes take less damage from attacks."
msgstr "英雄站在前排或后排。敌人大多攻击前排；狙击专打后排。战士和盗贼在后排的普通攻击只造成一半伤害，部分技能需要特定排。移动(7)可在一回合内换排。后排敌人受到的攻击伤害较低。"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2383 scripts/ui/Main.gd:3461
msgid "Controls"
msgstr "操作"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2383
msgid "Keyboard: 1-5 switch camp tabs; in a fight 1 Attack, 2-4 skills, 5 Defend, M opens More (6 Guard, 7 Move, 8 Tonics, 9 Call; their keys work either way), Space repeats the last action, Tab cycles targets, A toggles Auto, Esc goes back. Gamepad: D-pad and A work every menu, B goes back, LB/RB switch camp tabs. In a fight A repeats the last action, X Defends, Y uses the Ability, LB/RB the two skills, Start opens More (Guard, Move, Tonics, Call), the D-pad cycles targets, Select toggles Auto."
msgstr "键盘：1-5切换营地标签页；战斗中1为攻击，2-4为技能，5为防御，M打开更多（6守护、7移动、8药剂、9召唤；这些按键两种方式都可用），空格键重复上一个行动，Tab切换目标，A切换自动，Esc返回。手柄：十字键和A键可操作所有菜单，B返回，LB/RB切换营地标签页。战斗中A重复上一个行动，X防御，Y使用主动技能，LB/RB使用两个技能，Start打开更多（守护、移动、药剂、召唤），十字键切换目标，Select切换自动。"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2384
msgid "Momentum and skills"
msgstr "气势与技能"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2384
msgid "Momentum is the party's shared pool (up to 10, starting at 3). Each basic attack adds 1, each kill 1, and each hit taken while Defending or Guarding 1 (2 for a heavy blow). Every hero has two role skills (Lv1 and Lv6) and their subclass Ability (Lv3). Skills cost 2-4 Momentum, Abilities 4."
msgstr "气势是小队的共享池（最多10，初始3）。每次普通攻击+1，每次击杀+1，防御或守护时每次受击+1（重击+2）。每位英雄有两个职业技能（1级和6级）和子职业技能（3级）。职业技能消耗2-4气势，子职业技能消耗4。"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2385
msgid "Enemy moves"
msgstr "敌人招式"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2385
msgid "Each round a foe shows its next move above its health bar: an attack on a hero, a wind-up (a heavy blow next round), or a special move: Sweep (hits everyone), Snipe (the most-hurt back-row hero), Curse (40% less damage for 2 rounds), Ward, Mend or Roar. Shield Bash stuns a foe; Shield Bash and Frost Nova break wind-ups."
msgstr "每回合敌人会在血条上方显示下一招：攻击某名英雄、蓄力（下回合重击），或特殊招式：横扫（命中所有人）、狙击（后排受伤最重的英雄）、诅咒（2回合内伤害降低40%）、结界、治疗或咆哮。盾击可眩晕敌人；盾击和冰霜新星可打断蓄力。"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2386
msgid "Designed encounters"
msgstr "设计遭遇"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2386
msgid "About six regular fights in ten are one of a region's named encounters (Scarecrow Line, Reed Snipers, Forge Guard...), groups whose members play off each other: a warder shielding a brute, a healer behind a wall, snipers behind a tank. The name and a tactical hint open the fight log; hover the round label to read the hint again."
msgstr "大约十场普通战斗中有六场是该区域的命名遭遇（稻草人防线、芦苇狙击手、锻炉卫队……），成员之间互相配合：护盾者保护蛮兽、治疗者躲在墙后、狙击手藏在坦克身后。遭遇名称和战术提示会出现在战斗记录开头；悬停回合标签可再次查看提示。"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2387
msgid "Rift bosses"
msgstr "裂隙首领"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2387
msgid "Each boss is always the same fight. Vaelith's Harvest hits everyone and heals her, and she calls a Crier and a Warden at half health. Nyxara's Drowning Tide chills and weakens the party. Korrath's Sunder tears the wards off the front row. Drevok Brands a hero to take 50% more damage and calls fire cultists. Sythrane Immolates the party while she regenerates and enrages. Their signature moves are telegraphed like any other."
msgstr "每个首领的战斗总是相同的。Vaelith的收割打中所有人并为她回血，生命值降至一半时她召来一名啼者和一名守卫。Nyxara的溺亡之潮冰冻并削弱小队。Korrath的破甲撕掉前排的护盾。Drevok为一名英雄打上烙印使其受到伤害提高50%，并召来火焰邪教徒。Sythrane对小队施放献祭，同时再生并狂暴。它们的招牌招式和其他招式一样会被预示。"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2388
msgid "Every monster, boss, and hazard you've encountered is tracked as a silhouette-to-full-color reveal — pure record-keeping, no reward tied to completion."
msgstr "你遭遇过的每个怪物、首领和险境都会被记录，从剪影逐步揭示为全彩——纯粹的记录，完成不附带奖励。"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2389
msgid "Opens with Act IV, in the Rift Hall. 100 fixed floors, one fight each: a floor is always the same fight, so a loss is something to plan around. Heroes fight at full HP and leave as they came (no downing, scars or days passing). Most floors carry a rule (armored or burning foes, a swarm, a party cap). Every 10th floor is a guardian that gives a unique relic, and floors 10/25/50/75/100 earn guild titles. Only a first clear pays; floors 91-100 reshuffle their rules every week and pay half for a re-clear."
msgstr "第四幕开放，在裂隙大厅。100层固定楼层，每层一场战斗：同一层永远是同一场战斗，所以失败是可以计划应对的。英雄满血战斗，离开时与进入时一样（没有倒下、伤疤或时间流逝）。大多数楼层带有一条规则（重甲或燃烧的敌人、一群敌人、小队人数上限）。每第10层是守卫，掉落一件独特遗物，第10/25/50/75/100层可获得公会称号。只有首次通关有奖励；第91-100层每周重新洗牌规则，重复通关奖励减半。"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2390
msgid "Foes & regions"
msgstr "敌人与区域"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2390
msgid "Each rift is in a region (the Vale, the Marshes, the Ashen Wastes) with its own foes. Some foes wind up a heavy blow a turn ahead (x2.5, stuns unless the target Defends); armored foes shrug off part of every basic attack (each hit chips the armor; abilities ignore it); fire foes can burn and frost foes can chill (act late). A Field Tonic cleanses burn, chill, poison and stun."
msgstr "每座裂隙位于一个区域（山谷、沼泽、灰烬荒原），各有其敌人。有些敌人会提前一回合蓄力重击（×2.5，目标不防御则眩晕）；重甲敌人会抵消每次普通攻击的一部分（每次攻击会削弱护甲；技能无视护甲）；火焰敌人会造成燃烧，冰霜敌人会造成冰冻（行动靠后）。野战药剂可净化燃烧、冰冻、中毒和眩晕。"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2391
msgid "Six acts, each ending in a finale rift against a named foe. Meet an act's objectives (shown in the Rift Hall) to open its finale; sealing it pays a reward and a unique relic. Act I opens Greater Rifts, Act II the Descent."
msgstr "共六幕，每一幕都以对抗一名有名有姓之敌的终章裂隙收尾。达成一幕的目标（显示在裂隙大厅）即可开启其终章；封印终章可获得奖励和一件独特遗物。第一幕开启大型裂隙，第二幕开启深渊下行。"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2392
msgid "Relics bend rules: each is one of a kind, found from Act I's finale on (finales, elites, shops, events and the Tower's guardians), and sits on the Relic Altar for the whole guild. Stats live on gear. A sealed Rank D+ rift offers a Path relic instead, carried by a hero of that Path (one each) and passed between them at camp; it works while they fight. Declining one pays the seal's Essence."
msgstr "遗物改写规则：每件都独一无二，从第一幕终章起可获得（终章、精英、商店、事件和试炼之塔的守护者），放在遗物祭坛上，为整个公会生效。数值在装备上。封印D阶及以上的裂隙会改为提供一件道途遗物，由该道途的英雄携带（每人一件），可在营地相互传递；在其战斗时生效。放弃道途遗物则改为获得封印的精华。"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2393
msgid "Quirks"
msgstr "特质"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2393
msgid "Everything personal about a hero beyond class, skills and gear: at most one born quirk (it sets their voice), up to 2 scars from falling in a Rank C+ rift or a perilous expedition (a lasting mark with a small upside), and quirks earned by what they've done. Bad born quirks and scars can be treated for Gold at the Arcane Lab."
msgstr "英雄职业、技能与装备之外的一切个人特征：最多一个天生特质（决定其性格），最多2道在C+阶级裂隙或凶险远征中倒下留下的伤疤（永久印记，附带小小好处），以及凭所作所为获得的特质。不良的天生特质和伤疤可在奥术实验室花金币治疗。"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2394
msgid "From Act II a rift swells every so often: a rank, a place and a countdown in days (Rift Hall and the camp's status board). Seal a rift of that rank or higher before it runs out to close it, for a little Essence. Otherwise it breaks, and every rift run waits until your guild holds it: a breach rift of back-to-back fights (a fight, an elite and the breach's warden; the Inverted City's gate adds an elite) with no camp, shop or campfire between them. Ranks below S break out in a region; from S up they break at your camp. Holding pays Gold and Essence. Falling or turning back costs a share of your Essence and of the Gold beyond the coming payday's wages, and damages a building (two at the camp). The Accord Hall's Wardcraft rooms soften all of it."
msgstr "从第二幕起，时不时会有一座裂隙膨胀：显示阶级、地点和以天计的倒计时（裂隙大厅和营地状态板）。在倒计时结束前封印一座同阶或更高阶的裂隙即可将其关闭，获得少量精华。否则它会破开，所有裂隙行动都要等你的公会守住它：一座连续作战的裂口裂隙（一场战斗、一个精英和裂口的守卫；倒悬之城的城门多一个精英），中间没有营地、商店或营火。S阶以下在某个地区破开；S阶及以上在你的营地破开。守住可获得金币和精华。倒下或撤退会损失一部分精华，以及超出下个发薪日薪水之外的一部分金币，并损毁一座建筑（在营地则为两座）。盟约大厅的守御术房间可减轻这一切。"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2395
msgid "Each new guild meets twelve champions, drawn from a pool of twenty-four: three are freed at the end of Acts I, II and III, and nine are lost, each held in a pillar of light (in the Descent, and in ladder rifts from Rank B; reach one to free them). A champion never joins the roster. In rift runs one oversees the party: their Boon lifts everyone, and any hero can spend a turn on their Call (once a rift, twice from level 3). Essence levels them up (to 5)."
msgstr "每个新公会会遇到十二位勇者，从二十四位中抽取：三位在第一、二、三幕结束时获释，九位失落，各自困在一道光柱中（在深渊下行中，以及B阶起的天梯裂隙中；抵达光柱即可解放）。勇者从不加入名册。在裂隙行动中，由一位勇者担任小队的督军：其恩赐提升全员，任何英雄都可花一个回合发动其召唤（每座裂隙一次，3级起两次）。精华可提升其等级（最高5级）。"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2396 scripts/ui/RosterView.gd:542
msgid "Attributes"
msgstr "属性"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2396
msgid "Might (damage, HP), Agility (speed, dodge, first strike) and Focus (ability power, mend). Heroes gain 3 points per level to spend on the Roster's Hero tab; gear adds more, and better gear needs a minimum in its attribute to equip. Train up to 8 extra points at the Training Yard, or reset a hero's points for 5 Essence per level (gear they no longer qualify for comes off)."
msgstr "力量（伤害、生命）、敏捷（速度、闪避、先手）和专注（技能强度、回复）。英雄每升一级获得3点，在名册的英雄页分配；装备会额外增加，更好的装备需要对应属性达到最低值才能装备。可在训练场额外训练最多8点，或以每级5精华重置英雄的点数（不再满足要求的装备会被卸下）。"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2397
msgid "Quests & Milestones"
msgstr "任务与里程碑"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2397
msgid "The quest board posts 6 quests (hunts, boss bounties, rift seals, trials); take up to 3 at a time. Unaccepted postings are replaced every 3 days (a day passes with each rift run or rest). Milestones are a static checklist, auto-granted the moment they're met. A rare escort NPC can also tag along on a fight — surviving pays a small bonus."
msgstr "任务板发布6个任务（狩猎、首领悬赏、裂隙封印、试炼）；最多同时接3个。未接的委托每3天更换一次（每次裂隙行动或休息过去一天）。里程碑是固定清单，达成即自动发放。偶尔还会有稀有的护送NPC随队参战——活下来可获得一小笔奖励。"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2398
msgid "Wages, morale and the rival"
msgstr "薪水、士气与对手"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2398
msgid "Every 7 days (a day = one rift run or rest) heroes draw wages by rank and level, and every hall room level costs upkeep; see Guild > Ledger. Unpaid upkeep costs Renown. The Training Yard trains only a few attribute points a week (more with the Drill Yard), and a feast seats a limited number of heroes, lowest morale first (more with the Trade Network). The unpaid lose morale, and a hero unpaid twice in a row, or at rock-bottom morale on payday, walks out. Morale (0-100) rises with sealed rifts and feasts and falls with defeats, knockouts, idle weeks and failed contracts: Inspired heroes deal +10% damage, Shaken -10%, Breaking -20%. Taken contracts are due in 6-10 days. A rival guild gains Renown daily, and once a week it may make a move you answer before payday: court one of your heroes (match their offer, or they choose, staying only at morale 50 or above), dare you to seal a rift by payday (Renown rides on it), or go for a posted contract (take it on or lose it). Requests and the rival's moves pop up at camp and wait in the Ledger, whose week board shows each day to payday. At payday, the leader on Renown gets the better recruits. Every 28 days, whichever guild gained more Renown wins a prize."
msgstr "每7天（一天 = 一次裂隙出征或休息）英雄按等级和级别领取薪水，每级大厅房间都要维护费；见公会 > 账簿。拖欠维护费会损失声望。训练场每周只能训练几点属性（操练场可增加），宴会只能招待有限的英雄，士气最低的优先（贸易网络可增加）。未领到薪水的英雄士气下降，连续两次未领薪水，或发薪日士气跌到谷底的英雄会离开。士气（0-100）随封印裂隙和宴会上升，随失败、倒下、闲置的周和失败的契约下降：振奋的英雄伤害+10%，动摇的-10%，崩溃的-20%。接下的契约在6-10天内到期。对手公会每天获得声望，每周可能出一招，你需在发薪日前回应：拉拢你的一位英雄（开出同样的条件，或由英雄选择，士气50以上才会留下），挑战你在发薪日前封印一道裂隙（声望押在上面），或抢一份已发布的契约（接下或失去）。请求和对手的动向会在营地弹出，并在账簿中等待，账簿的周表显示到发薪日的每一天。发薪日时，声望领先者得到更好的招募。每28天，声望增长更多的公会赢得奖品。"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2399
msgid "Twice a week a hero may ask for something: time off, a raise, Gold for kit, a Training Yard slot, a partner, a rift of their own, your side in a feud, and more. Saying yes costs something and can leave them a title, a quirk or a bond; saying no costs morale. Answer in the Ledger before payday, or it counts as a no."
msgstr "每周两次，英雄可能会提出请求：休假、加薪、买装备的金币、训练场名额、一个搭档、一座属于自己的裂隙、在争执中站在其一边，等等。答应要付出代价，可能让其获得称号、特质或羁绊；拒绝则损失士气。须在发薪日前于账簿中回应，否则视为拒绝。"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2400 scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2450
msgid "Expeditions"
msgstr "远征"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2400
msgid "From two seals, the Quest board's Expeditions tab posts three jobs off the map: a safe one, a hard one and (from Act II) a perilous one, each with a Need in power, a length of 1-3 days and a party of up to 3. Heroes you send are away for those days and still draw wages. The odds show before they go: 50% at the Need, better above it. Success pays in full; a partial pays half and someone comes back hurt; a failure pays nothing and hurts the party, and on a perilous job it can leave a scar. Every class and every Path brings something on the road, once per party: a warrior's muscle and a ranger's scouting raise the odds, a mage appraises (+50% Essence), a rogue pockets more (+25% Gold), a cleric halves the hurt, and each Path adds its own. Heroes are gone for the whole days while rifts and breaches go on without them. Everyone learns on the road, as at the Training Yard. One party out at a time, two with a Scouts' Lodge at level 3."
msgstr "封印两座裂隙后，任务板的远征页会发布三份地图之外的任务：一份安全、一份困难，以及（第二幕起）一份凶险，每份都有战力需求、1-3天的时长，小队最多3人。派出的英雄在这几天里不在，但仍领薪水。出发前会显示成功率：刚好达到需求时为50%，超出越多越高。成功则全额支付；部分成功付一半，且有人负伤归来；失败则分文不得，全队受伤，凶险任务还可能留下伤疤。每个职业和每条道途在路上都有所助益，每支小队各计一次：战士的蛮力和游侠的侦察提高成功率，法师负责鉴定（精华+50%），盗贼多揣一些（金币+25%），牧师让伤势减半，每条道途另有加成。英雄整天不在，裂隙和裂口照常推进。每个人都能在路上有所长进，与训练场相同。同一时间只能派出一支小队，斥候小屋达到3级后可派两支。"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2401
msgid "Camp events"
msgstr "营地事件"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2401
msgid "On about a third of days something happens at camp, and each is a choice: a travelling merchant, a renowned hero who drills one of yours, a wandering recruit, a relic peddler, a smith's apprentice, a scholar; a festival, refugees, a debt, the rival's quartermaster. Threats (fire, fever, bandits, a storm, a rift tremor) are foretold the evening before (the status board and the week's calendar): pay, send a hero who stays home that day, or take the loss. An event left unanswered takes its last option the next day. Act I brings only opportunities."
msgstr "大约三分之一的日子营地会发生些什么，每件事都是一个选择：游商、来操练你手下英雄的知名英雄、流浪的新兵、遗物小贩、铁匠学徒、学者；节庆、难民、债务、对手的军需官。威胁（火灾、热病、强盗、风暴、裂隙震动）会在前一晚预示（状态板和本周日历）：付钱、派一名英雄当天留守，或承受损失。未答复的事件会在第二天采取最后一个选项。第一幕只会带来机遇。"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2402
msgid "Wounds and falls"
msgstr "创伤与倒下"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2402
msgid "From Rank C a landed heavy blow (a wind-up's strike) or any hit worth a quarter of a hero's max HP wounds them: half the damage also comes off their max HP, and no healing refills it (up to 60%). A hero who Defends, is Guarded or dodges is never wounded, and every ordinary fight from Rank C has a wind-up to answer by round 2. Up to Rank A wounds close when the fight ends; from Rank S they last the whole run (a campfire's Rest halves them, a shrine closes some), so a party meets the boss with what it has left. A hero who falls in a Rank C+ rift (after your third seal) may keep a scar (15% at C, up to 35% at SS; a cleric, Warding and Aegis heroes and the Healers' Wing lower it) and drops one piece of worn gear in the rift, back home only if the party seals it. From Rank SS a hero who already has two scars can die when they fall; the Party screen names them before you go. Never in training, the Daily, the Tower, the Descent, breach rifts or Story."
msgstr "从C阶级起，命中的重击（蓄力后的一击）或任何达到英雄最大生命四分之一的攻击都会造成创伤：一半伤害同时扣除其最大生命，任何治疗都无法补回（最多60%）。防御中、受守护或闪避的英雄不会受创，且从C阶级起每场普通战斗都会在第2回合前出现一次需要应对的蓄力。A阶级及以下，创伤在战斗结束时愈合；从S阶级起会持续整个探索（营火休息可减半，圣坛能愈合一部分），因此小队只能带着剩下的状态面对首领。在C+阶级裂隙中倒下的英雄（第三次封印之后）可能留下伤疤（C阶级15%，SS阶级最高35%；牧师、护佑与圣盾道途的英雄以及治疗翼楼可降低几率），并会把一件穿戴中的装备遗落在裂隙中，只有小队封印该裂隙才能带回。从SS阶级起，已有两道伤疤的英雄倒下时可能死亡；出发前小队界面会点出其名字。训练、每日挑战、试炼之塔、深渊下行、裂口裂隙和剧情难度中都不会发生。"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2403
msgid "The deep road"
msgstr "深处之路"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2403
msgid "From Rank S the ordinary fights between you and the boss are harder: their foes have half again the health and hit half again as hard, and every hit a hero takes unguarded leaves a small trace on their max HP that lasts the run. Momentum decides who strikes first: a party that starts the fight with 5 Momentum or more keeps the initiative; with less, every foe acts first in round 1. Momentum left after a won fight on the road carries into the next one, so spending it to finish fast and banking it to strike first is a choice every fight."
msgstr "从S阶开始，你与首领之间的普通战斗更难：敌人生命多一半，打得也狠一半；英雄每次在无人守护时挨打，都会在最大生命上留下一点持续整次探索的痕迹。气势决定谁先出手：开战时气势达到5点或更多的小队保住先机；不足时，第1回合所有敌人先行动。路上打赢一场后剩余的气势会带入下一场，所以把它花掉速战速决，还是存起来抢先出手，每场战斗都是一次抉择。"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2404
msgid "The rift map"
msgstr "裂隙地图"

#: scripts/ui/GuildViews.gd:2404
msgid "A ranked rift is a map of lanes: Ranks F-E have 3, D-B 4, A and up 5. Each node leads on to its own lane and one or both neighbours on the next floor, so plan a route: an elite on the way to a treasure, a shop before the boss. Every route ends at a campfire before the boss. Anvils temper a worn piece for free, a Path's shrine teaches the party (its Path's heroes most), and a trainer's echo gives one hero a level. From Rank S, floors more than two ahead are unseen unless a Trapper or a Stalker scouts."
msgstr "有阶级的裂隙是一张路线图：F-E阶3条路线，D-B阶4条，A阶及以上5条。每个节点通往下一层的同一路线及相邻的一条或两条，所以要规划路线：去宝藏的路上打一场精英，首领前逛一次商店。每条路线都在首领前以营火结束。铁砧可免费淬炼一件磨损的装备，道途圣坛会指导小队（该道途的英雄收获最多），训练师的回响可使一名英雄升一级。从S阶起，除非有陷阱师或潜猎者侦察，否则看不到两层以外的楼层。"

