msgid "Carry out the archive"
msgstr "搬出档案"

#: scripts/ui/Main.gd:609
msgid "-%d Renown. Ledger pages and the Vale's story turn up half again as often, and Act IV's finale is %d%% weaker"
msgstr "-%d声望。账簿残页和山谷的故事出现频率提高一半，第四幕终章减弱%d%%"

