msgstr "把她赶回去"

#: scripts/ui/Main.gd:612
msgid "As the story goes: she falls back through the Breach"
msgstr "如故事所述：她跌回裂口之中"

#: scripts/ui/Main.gd:613
msgid "Let her go"
msgstr "放她走"

#: scripts/ui/Main.gd:613
msgid "No relic from this finale and half its Essence. She joins as a champion; Act IV's finale is %d%% weaker"
msgstr "本终章不掉落遗物，精华减半。她以勇者身份加入；第四幕终章减弱%d%%"

#: scripts/ui/Main.gd:615
msgid "Accept the verdict"
msgstr "接受裁决"

#: scripts/ui/Main.gd:615
msgid "The Charter goes to the guild with more Renown"
msgstr "特许状归声望更高的公会"

#: scripts/ui/Main.gd:616
msgid "Buy the Charter (%d Gold)"
msgstr "购买特许状（%d金币）"

#: scripts/ui/Main.gd:616
msgid "Contracts pay 10% more, not 20%. No Laurels for it, and the Crown's auditors come in Act IV"
msgstr "契约多付10%而非20%。不获得桂冠，第四幕中王冠的审计官会来"

#: scripts/ui/Main.gd:619
msgid "Keep the key"
msgstr "留下钥匙"

#: scripts/ui/Main.gd:619
msgid "Choose each rift's region; every Riftbreak comes a rank higher"
msgstr "自选每座裂隙的区域；每次裂隙崩溃提高一阶"

#: scripts/ui/Main.gd:620
msgid "Break it"
msgstr "毁掉它"

#: scripts/ui/Main.gd:620
msgid "+%d Renown, a day more warning before Riftbreaks; the Grandmaster's Hall costs a quarter more"
msgstr "+%d声望，裂隙崩溃多一天预警；大团长的大厅花费多四分之一"

#: scripts/ui/Main.gd:623
msgid "Keep your echoes"
msgstr "留下你的回响"

#: scripts/ui/Main.gd:623
msgid "Ezra goes on his way"
msgstr "Ezra继续上路"

#: scripts/ui/Main.gd:624
msgid "Pour them into the lantern"
msgstr "把它们倒进灯里"

#: scripts/ui/Main.gd:624
msgid "-%d Essence and Echo-Touched heroes lose the quirk; contracts pay 10%% more Essence, and the Vale remembers what you gave"
msgstr "-%d精华，回响之触的英雄失去该特质；契约多付10%%精华，山谷会记住你所给予的"

#: scripts/ui/Main.gd:626
msgid "Keep the doors open"
msgstr "让大门敞开"

#: scripts/ui/Main.gd:626
msgid "Both worlds: Hollow-born heroes join your recruit board, in later guilds too"
msgstr "两个世界：空洞所生的英雄加入你的招募板，此后的公会也是"

#: scripts/ui/Main.gd:627
msgid "Close every door"
msgstr "关上所有大门"

#: scripts/ui/Main.gd:627
msgid "Ours: +%d Laurels, and the Hollow's foes leave the ladder"
msgstr "我们的：+%d桂冠，空洞的敌人离开天梯"

