msgid "How much should the guild's old hands tell you?"
msgstr "公会的老手们该给你讲多少？"

#: scripts/ui/Main.gd:663
msgid "Guide me through everything"
msgstr "全程指导我"

#: scripts/ui/Main.gd:663
msgid "A tip on every screen the first time you open it (as now)."
msgstr "首次打开每个界面时都有提示（与现在相同）。"

#: scripts/ui/Main.gd:664
