#: scripts/ui/Main.gd:710
msgid "+%d Renown. The Company will strike back: a Riftbreak at your door."
msgstr "+%d声望。佣兵团会反击：一次裂隙崩溃将来到你门前。"

#: scripts/ui/Main.gd:712
msgid "Keep quiet"
msgstr "保持沉默"

#: scripts/ui/Main.gd:715
msgid "Contracts pay %d%% more Gold for the rest of the campaign. The Accord said: never sell a rift."
msgstr "本战役余下时间契约多付%d%%金币。盟约说过：绝不出卖裂隙。"

