msgid "Turn Morrow (%d Gold)"
msgstr "策反Morrow（%d金币）"

#: scripts/ui/Main.gd:723
msgid "You know who pays him. Morrow joins as a Rank S rogue on double wages and the Company stops hunting; the Crown will remember at its hearing."
msgstr "你知道谁在付他钱。Morrow以S阶盗贼身份加入，领双倍薪水，佣兵团停止追杀；王冠会在听证会上记住这件事。"

#: scripts/ui/Main.gd:734
msgid "Give it back (+%d Renown)"
msgstr "归还（+%d声望）"

#: scripts/ui/Main.gd:738
msgid "Keep it (+%d Essence)"
msgstr "留下（+%d精华）"

#: scripts/ui/Main.gd:755
msgid "Who takes the forty-first post?"
msgstr "谁来接过第四十一个岗位？"

#: scripts/ui/Main.gd:757
msgid "%s — Rank %s, Lv%d"
msgstr "%s — %s阶，%d级"

#: scripts/ui/Main.gd:763
msgid "They leave the guild forever and go on the Memorial. Riftbreaks end."
msgstr "他们将永远离开公会，名字刻上纪念碑。裂隙崩溃结束。"

