msgstr "让%s退隐"

#: scripts/ui/Main.gd:835
msgid "The Vale will remember the %s"
msgstr "山谷会记住%s"

#: scripts/ui/Main.gd:840
msgid "The guild leaves its save slot for the Hall of Guilds, where its record stays. It can't be played again."
msgstr "公会将其存档栏位让给公会之殿，其记录将留存于此。它无法再被游玩。"

