#: scripts/ui/Main.gd:2777
msgid "Rule: %s\nStarting boon: %s (%s)\nOne try a day, any rank. Every guild faces the same twist today; seal it for +%d Essence and a longer streak."
msgstr "规则：%s\n初始恩赐：%s（%s）\n每天一次机会，任意阶级。今天每个公会面对的变奏都相同；封印它可获得+%d精华并延长连续纪录。"

#: scripts/ui/Main.gd:2809
msgid "Hold the breach — Rank %s near %s"
msgstr "守住裂口 — %s阶，%s附近"

#: scripts/ui/Main.gd:2812
msgid "%d fights in a row with no camp, shop or campfire between them, the last against the breach's warden. Hold, and the guild is paid; fall or turn back, and it costs part of your Essence and of the Gold above the coming bill, and damages a building. Up to 4 heroes; it takes the day."
msgstr "连续%d场战斗，中间没有营地、商店或营火，最后一场对抗裂口的守卫。守住，公会就能获得报酬；倒下或撤退，会损失部分精华和超出即将到来账单的金币，并损坏一座建筑。最多4名英雄；耗时一天。"

