#: scripts/ui/RiftRunView.gd:12
msgid "Combat — 1-3 monsters. Gold, Essence and a loot pick."
msgstr "战斗 — 1-3只怪物。金币、精华和一次战利品选择。"

#: scripts/ui/RiftRunView.gd:13
msgid "Elite — one tough foe (double HP, harder hits). +40% rewards."
msgstr "精英 — 一个强敌（双倍生命，攻击更重）。奖励+40%。"

#: scripts/ui/RiftRunView.gd:14
msgid "Shop — spend Gold on items and relics. No fighting."
msgstr "商店 — 花金币购买物品和遗物。没有战斗。"

#: scripts/ui/RiftRunView.gd:15
msgid "Hazard — a trap that hurts the party (hazard guard helps). May drop Gold or Essence."
msgstr "险境 — 伤害小队的陷阱（险境防护有帮助）。可能掉落金币或精华。"

#: scripts/ui/RiftRunView.gd:16
msgid "Boss — the rift's warden, with a special mechanic. Win to seal the rift."
msgstr "首领 — 裂隙的守卫，带有特殊机制。获胜即可封印裂隙。"

#: scripts/ui/RiftRunView.gd:17
msgid "Campfire — rest (heal), train (XP) or sharpen (abilities ready). No fighting."
msgstr "营火 — 休息（治疗）、训练（经验）或磨砺（技能就绪）。没有战斗。"

#: scripts/ui/RiftRunView.gd:18
msgid "Event — a strange encounter with a few choices; each says what it does."
msgstr "事件 — 一次奇异的遭遇，有几个选项；每个都会说明效果。"

#: scripts/ui/RiftRunView.gd:19
msgid "Treasure — pick one of two loot drops. No fighting."
msgstr "宝藏 — 从两份战利品中选一份。没有战斗。"

#: scripts/ui/RiftRunView.gd:20
msgid "Pillar — a lost champion is held in this light. Its keeper fights like a rift warden; win to free them."
msgstr "光柱 — 一位迷失的勇者被困在这道光中。其看守者的战斗方式如同裂隙守卫；获胜即可解放勇者。"

#: scripts/ui/RiftRunView.gd:21
msgid "Anvil — temper one piece your party wears, one Forge level, free. No fighting."
msgstr "铁砧 — 免费淬炼小队穿戴的一件装备，提升一级锻炉等级。没有战斗。"

#: scripts/ui/RiftRunView.gd:22
msgid "Shrine — a Path's shrine: XP for the party, most for heroes on that Path. No fighting."
msgstr "圣坛 — 某条道途的圣坛：小队获得经验，该道途的英雄最多。没有战斗。"

#: scripts/ui/RiftRunView.gd:23
msgid "Trainer's echo — one hero trains with an old master's echo and gains a level. No fighting."
msgstr "训练师的回响 — 一名英雄与老师傅的回响一同训练，升一级。没有战斗。"

#: scripts/ui/RiftRunView.gd:24
